window.STUDY_INDEX=[{"type": "知识点", "label": "极形式、乘方与开方", "text": "复数的模表示长度，辐角表示方向。乘法把长度相乘、角度相加；开 $n$ 次方会出现 $n$ 个等间隔根。 乘除用极式，求实虚部用代数式；求根记得分支。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-polar", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Polar form, powers, and roots", "textEn": "The modulus of a complex number is its distance from the origin. Its argument is its direction angle. Multiplication multiplies distances and adds angles. Taking an $n$th root gives $n$ equally spaced roots. Use polar form for multiplication and division. Use Cartesian form to find real and imaginary parts. List every branch when finding roots."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "平方根支点与黎曼面", "text": "绕一个零点一周后函数值改变，说明这里是支点。对平方根，奇数阶零点或极点会使符号翻转；切开平面后可选单值分支，再将两张割面交叉粘合。 支点看绕圈是否变值，不能把每个奇点都叫支点。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-branch", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Square-root branch points and Riemann surfaces", "textEn": "A point is a branch point if going once around it changes the function value. For a square root, a zero or pole of odd order reverses the sign. Cuts let us choose a single-valued branch. Two cut copies of the plane can then be joined crosswise. A branch point is detected by a change after a circuit. A singular point is not automatically a branch point."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "柯西–黎曼条件与调和共轭", "text": "复导数要求从任意方向逼近都得到同一值，比实函数可微更强。先分出 $u,v$，再检查两条 C–R 方程。解析要求在一个开邻域内处处可导。 先验调和，再用 C–R 积分，最后用初值定常数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-cr", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Cauchy–Riemann equations and harmonic conjugates", "textEn": "A complex derivative must have the same limit from every direction. This is stronger than real differentiability. First separate $u,v$, then check both C–R equations. Analyticity means differentiability throughout an open neighborhood. Check that the given part is harmonic. Integrate C–R to find the other part. Use the initial value to fix the constant."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "调和函数与正交曲线", "text": "解析函数的实部与虚部都是调和函数；在导数非零的点，等实部与等虚部曲线垂直。 调和是必要条件；正交结论别漏临界点。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-harmonic", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Harmonic functions and orthogonal curves", "textEn": "The real and imaginary parts of an analytic function are harmonic. Where its derivative is nonzero, the curves of constant real part and constant imaginary part meet at right angles. Harmonicity is a necessary condition. Check critical points before claiming orthogonality."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "柯西积分公式与积分估计", "text": "路径上含共轭、实部或虚部时，通常直接参数化；解析函数的闭路积分先看区域内奇点。柯西公式把积分转换成某点的函数值或导数。 先判内部奇点，再匹配分母幂次，最后检查方向与阶乘。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-cauchy", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Cauchy integral formula and integral bounds", "textEn": "If the integrand contains a conjugate, real part, or imaginary part, parameterizing the path is usually the direct approach. For a closed contour, first locate the singularities inside. The Cauchy formula turns an integral into a function value or derivative at one point. Locate the enclosed singularities. Match the denominator power. Check the orientation and factorial."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "泰勒、洛朗展开及收敛环域", "text": "同一个有理函数在不同环域有不同级数。先平移中心，再按距离中心的各个奇点划分圆环；每个因子都应变为绝对值小于一的几何级数。 先画奇点距离，再决定展开变量是 $z$ 还是 $1/z$。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-laurent", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Taylor and Laurent expansions and their annuli", "textEn": "The same rational function can have different series in different annuli. First shift the expansion center. Use the distances to the singularities to divide the plane into rings. Rewrite each factor as a geometric series whose ratio has modulus less than one. Mark the singularity distances first. Then decide whether the small expansion variable is $z$ or $1/z$."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "可去、极点与本性奇点", "text": "洛朗级数的负幂部分决定孤立奇点类型。无穷远改用 $w=1/z$，但若有限奇点不断趋于无穷远，无穷远就不是孤立奇点。 先消零点，再判阶数；分母为零不一定是极点。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-singularity", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Removable singularities, poles, and essential singularities", "textEn": "The negative-power part of a Laurent series classifies an isolated singularity. At infinity, use $w=1/z$. If finite singularities continue out toward infinity, infinity is not isolated. Cancel zeros before determining the order. A zero denominator does not always produce a pole."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "留数与高阶极点", "text": "留数是洛朗展开中 $(z-a)^{-1}$ 的系数。简单极点用极限，高阶极点用求导，本性奇点通常展开后取系数。 留数只取负一次；极点阶数减一再求导。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-residue", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Residues and poles of higher order", "textEn": "A residue is the coefficient of $(z-a)^{-1}$ in a Laurent expansion. Use a limit for a simple pole, derivatives for a higher-order pole, and usually a series coefficient for an essential singularity. Only the power minus one determines the residue. Subtract one from the pole order to get the derivative order."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "实积分的围道选择", "text": "有理函数衰减够快时闭合上半圆；带 $e^{ikx}$ 时根据 $k$ 的符号选择半平面；三角积分令 $z=e^{i\\theta}$；幂函数可使用扇形或钥匙孔围道。 先验收敛与实轴极点，再选围道；半轴偶函数记得除二。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-contour", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Choosing a contour for a real integral", "textEn": "For a sufficiently decaying rational function, close with an upper semicircle. With $e^{ikx}$, choose the half-plane from the sign of $k$. For a trigonometric integral, set $z=e^{i\\theta}$. Powers may suggest a sector or keyhole contour. Check convergence and real-axis poles before choosing the contour. For an even integrand, remember to halve the whole-line result."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "实部与虚部的 Hilbert 变换联系", "text": "上半平面解析且在无穷远衰减的函数，其边界实部与虚部不是独立的。绕实轴点的小半圆产生半留数，从而得到主值公式。 正负号取决于解析半平面和核的方向；别只背 Hilbert 变换名称。", "url": "chapter-1.html#c1-dispersion", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Hilbert-transform relations between real and imaginary parts", "textEn": "If a function is analytic in the upper half-plane and decays at infinity, its boundary real and imaginary parts are linked. A small semicircle around a real-axis point supplies half a residue term and leads to a principal-value formula. The signs depend on the analytic half-plane and the direction of the kernel. Learn those choices along with the Hilbert-transform name."}, {"type": "习题 1.1-1", "label": "复数四则运算", "text": "计算实部与虚部：(1) $(4+i)/(2-5i)$；(2) $(1+2i)/(3-4i)+(2+3i)/(5i)$；(3) $5/[(1-i)(2-i)(3-i)]$；(4) $(1-i)^4$。 分母实数化 → 合并实虚部 → 用模长粗验。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.1-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.1-1", "labelEn": "Arithmetic with complex numbers", "textEn": "Find the real and imaginary parts: (1) $(4+i)/(2-5i)$; (2) $(1+2i)/(3-4i)+(2+3i)/(5i)$; (3) $5/[(1-i)(2-i)(3-i)]$; (4) $(1-i)^4$. Make the denominator real → collect real and imaginary parts → check the size using moduli."}, {"type": "习题 1.1-2", "label": "模与辐角", "text": "求模与辐角：(1) $(1+i)/(2-2\\sqrt3 i)$；(2) $(1-i)^3$；(3) $(1/5+2i/5)(3-i)$；(4) $(\\sqrt3-i)^4$。 先分别求模、角，再合成，最后归入指定主值区间。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.1-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.1-2", "labelEn": "Modulus and argument", "textEn": "Find the modulus and argument: (1) $(1+i)/(2-2\\sqrt3 i)$; (2) $(1-i)^3$; (3) $(1/5+2i/5)(3-i)$; (4) $(\\sqrt3-i)^4$. Find each modulus and angle → combine them → move the final angle into the requested principal range."}, {"type": "习题 1.1-3", "label": "复平面轨迹", "text": "描述轨迹：(1) $|z-3i|+|z+3i|=9$；(2) $|z-2+i|\\le3$；(3) $0<\\arg[(z-i)/(z+i)]<\\pi/4$（取主辐角）。 把模解释成距离，把辐角解释成转角；复杂映射可转成实虚部不等式。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.1-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.1-3", "labelEn": "Loci in the complex plane", "textEn": "Describe each locus: (1) $|z-3i|+|z+3i|=9$; (2) $|z-2+i|\\le3$; (3) $0<\\arg[(z-i)/(z+i)]<\\pi/4$, using the principal argument. Read modulus as distance and argument as angle. For a complicated mapping, turn the condition into inequalities for real and imaginary parts."}, {"type": "习题 1.1-4", "label": "复幂与三角和", "text": "计算：(1) $i^i$；(2) $\\sin\\phi+\\sin2\\phi+\\cdots+\\sin n\\phi$。 先写指数形式，再用多值对数或等比和。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.1-4", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.1-4", "labelEn": "Complex powers and trigonometric sums", "textEn": "Calculate: (1) $i^i$; (2) $\\sin\\phi+\\sin2\\phi+\\cdots+\\sin n\\phi$. Write exponential form first. Then use either the multivalued logarithm or the geometric-sum formula."}, {"type": "习题 1.1-5", "label": "三次单位根", "text": "求 $z^2+z+1=0$。 识别单位根多项式，再剔除引入的根。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.1-5", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.1-5", "labelEn": "Cube roots of unity", "textEn": "Solve $z^2+z+1=0$. Recognize a polynomial associated with roots of unity → remove any root introduced by multiplication."}, {"type": "习题 1.2-1", "label": "定义域排除条件", "text": "求定义域：(1) $f=1/(z^2+9)$；(2) $f=z/[(z+z^*)(4-|z|^2)]$。 代数分母逐因子排零 → 转几何条件。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.2-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.2-1", "labelEn": "Finding the domain", "textEn": "Find the domain: (1) $f=1/(z^2+9)$; (2) $f=z/[(z+z^*)(4-|z|^2)]$. Exclude the zero set of each denominator factor → describe those sets geometrically."}, {"type": "习题 1.2-2", "label": "分离实部虚部", "text": "写成 $u+iv$：(1) $z^3+2zz^*-2$；(2) $3e^{iz}$。 先消共轭与指数，再按实虚部收集。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.2-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.2-2", "labelEn": "Separating real and imaginary parts", "textEn": "Write each expression as $u+iv$: (1) $z^3+2zz^*-2$; (2) $3e^{iz}$. Remove conjugates and rewrite exponentials first → collect the real and imaginary terms."}, {"type": "习题 1.2-3", "label": "四个支点与两叶黎曼面", "text": "确定 $f(z)=\\sqrt{3z(z^2+9)}$ 的支点并构造相应黎曼面。 有限奇数阶零极点 + 无穷远变换 → 配对割线 → 双叶交叉粘合。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.2-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.2-3", "labelEn": "Four branch points and a two-sheeted Riemann surface", "textEn": "Find the branch points of $f(z)=\\sqrt{3z(z^2+9)}$ and construct its Riemann surface. Check finite zeros and poles of odd order, plus infinity → pair the cuts → join the two sheets crosswise."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-1", "label": "逐点可导与区域解析", "text": "判断可导与解析位置：(1) $z+3z^*$；(2) $x^2-y^2-2y+i(2x-2xy)$；(3) $z+1/z$；(4) $\\cos x\\cosh y-i\\sin x\\sinh y$。 求 C–R 点集 → 利用偏导连续判断可导 → 看是否有开邻域。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-1", "labelEn": "Differentiability at points versus analyticity on a region", "textEn": "Find where each function is differentiable and analytic: (1) $z+3z^*$; (2) $x^2-y^2-2y+i(2x-2xy)$; (3) $z+1/z$; (4) $\\cos x\\cosh y-i\\sin x\\sinh y$. Solve C–R → use continuity of partial derivatives to establish differentiability → check for an open neighborhood."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-2", "label": "解析函数判定：某点可导还不够", "text": "判断下列条件能否给出解析函数：(1) $f=z^2+2zz^*-2$；(2) $\\operatorname{Re}f=x^2+y^2$。 实部已知时先验调和，可立即否定。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-2", "labelEn": "Analyticity: one differentiable point is not enough", "textEn": "Determine whether these conditions define an analytic function: (1) $f=z^2+2zz^*-2$; (2) $\\operatorname{Re}f=x^2+y^2$. When the real part is given, test harmonicity first. It can rule out the function immediately."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-3", "label": "由实部或虚部重建解析函数", "text": "求解析函数：(1) $u=x^2-y^2,f(0)=0$；(2) $v=e^x\\sin y,f(0)=0$；(3) $u=x/(x^2+y^2),f(2)=1/2$；(4) $v=x^2-y^2+xy,f(i)=1-i$。 验调和 → 积分一条 C–R → 另一条补函数 → 初值定常数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-3", "labelEn": "Reconstructing an analytic function from one part", "textEn": "Find the analytic function: (1) $u=x^2-y^2,f(0)=0$; (2) $v=e^x\\sin y,f(0)=0$; (3) $u=x/(x^2+y^2),f(2)=1/2$; (4) $v=x^2-y^2+xy,f(i)=1-i$. Check harmonicity → integrate one C–R equation → use the other to determine the leftover function → apply the initial value."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-4", "label": "极坐标 C–R 条件", "text": "证明 $u_\\rho=\\rho^{-1}v_\\phi$，$v_\\rho=-\\rho^{-1}u_\\phi$。 先完整写链式法则，再代直角坐标 C–R。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-4", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-4", "labelEn": "C–R equations in polar coordinates", "textEn": "Prove $u_\\rho=\\rho^{-1}v_\\phi$ and $v_\\rho=-\\rho^{-1}u_\\phi$. Write the full chain rule first → substitute Cartesian C–R."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-5", "label": "极坐标调和方程", "text": "证明解析函数的实虚部满足 $\\rho^2u_{\\rho\\rho}+\\rho u_\\rho+u_{\\phi\\phi}=0$ 及对应的 $v$ 方程。 C–R 乘半径 → 两次求导 → 混合导数抵消。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-5", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-5", "labelEn": "The harmonic equation in polar coordinates", "textEn": "Prove that the real and imaginary parts of an analytic function satisfy $\\rho^2u_{\\rho\\rho}+\\rho u_\\rho+u_{\\phi\\phi}=0$ and the corresponding equation for $v$. Multiply C–R by the radius → differentiate twice → cancel mixed derivatives."}, {"type": "习题 1.3-6", "label": "等实部与等虚部曲线正交", "text": "证明解析函数的曲线族 $u(x,y)=c_1$ 与 $v(x,y)=c_2$ 在相交点切线垂直。 梯度内积为零 → 检查非零梯度 → 得出切线结论。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.3-6", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.3-6", "labelEn": "Orthogonality of real- and imaginary-part level curves", "textEn": "Prove that the families $u(x,y)=c_1$ and $v(x,y)=c_2$ have perpendicular tangents at their intersection points. Show that the gradient dot product is zero → check that the gradients are nonzero → conclude that the tangents are perpendicular."}, {"type": "习题 1.4-1", "label": "非解析被积函数的路径积分", "text": "计算 $\\int_0^{2+i}\\operatorname{Im}z\\,dz$：(1) $0\\to2\\to2+i$；(2) 直线段 $0\\to2+i$；(3) $0\\to1+i\\to2+i$。 分段参数化 → 代入函数与微分 → 相加。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.4-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.4-1", "labelEn": "Path integrals of a nonanalytic integrand", "textEn": "Evaluate $\\int_0^{2+i}\\operatorname{Im}z\\,dz$: (1) $0\\to2\\to2+i$; (2) the straight segment $0\\to2+i$; (3) $0\\to1+i\\to2+i$. Parameterize each segment → substitute both the function and differential → add the contributions."}, {"type": "习题 1.4-2", "label": "圆弧积分方向", "text": "计算 $\\int_C(z+2)/z\\,dz$：(1) 单位圆上半圆 $0\\le\\arg z\\le\\pi$；(2) 下半圆 $\\pi\\le\\arg z\\le2\\pi$；(3) 逆时针单位圆。 拆解析部分和 $1/z$ 部分 → 用端点、角度。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.4-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.4-2", "labelEn": "Orientation of circular arcs", "textEn": "Evaluate $\\int_C(z+2)/z\\,dz$: (1) the upper unit semicircle $0\\le\\arg z\\le\\pi$; (2) the lower semicircle $\\pi\\le\\arg z\\le2\\pi$; (3) the counterclockwise unit circle. Separate the analytic part from the $1/z$ part → use endpoint differences and angle changes."}, {"type": "习题 1.4-3", "label": "ML 积分估计", "text": "$C$ 为第一象限内半径 $2$ 的四分之一圆弧。证明 (1) $|\\int_C(z-2)/(z^4+1)dz|\\le4\\pi/15$；(2) $|\\int_C(z+4)/(z^3-1)dz|\\le6\\pi/7$。 先长度、再上界、最后相乘；证明上界不必求精确最大值。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.4-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.4-3", "labelEn": "The ML integral estimate", "textEn": "$C$ is a quarter-circle of radius $2$ in the first quadrant. Prove (1) $|\\int_C(z-2)/(z^4+1)dz|\\le4\\pi/15$; (2) $|\\int_C(z+4)/(z^3-1)dz|\\le6\\pi/7$. Find the length, then a modulus bound, then multiply. An upper bound need not be the exact maximum."}, {"type": "习题 1.4-4", "label": "原函数、柯西定理与积分公式", "text": "计算：(1) $\\int_0^{1+i}z^2dz$；(2) $\\int_0^{\\pi+2i}\\cos(z/2)dz$；(3) $\\oint_{|z|=1/2}\\cos z/(z^2-1)dz$；(4) $\\oint_{|z|=4}\\sin z/(z^2+9)dz$；(5) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\cos z/z\\,dz$；(6) $\\oint_{|z-i|=1}(z^2-1)/(z^2+1)dz$。闭路均取正向。 原函数优先 → 圈内奇点计数 → 柯西公式或留数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.4-4", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.4-4", "labelEn": "Antiderivatives, Cauchy's theorem, and the integral formula", "textEn": "Evaluate: (1) $\\int_0^{1+i}z^2dz$; (2) $\\int_0^{\\pi+2i}\\cos(z/2)dz$; (3) $\\oint_{|z|=1/2}\\cos z/(z^2-1)dz$; (4) $\\oint_{|z|=4}\\sin z/(z^2+9)dz$; (5) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\cos z/z\\,dz$; (6) $\\oint_{|z-i|=1}(z^2-1)/(z^2+1)dz$. All closed contours are positively oriented. Try an antiderivative → count enclosed singularities → apply Cauchy's formula or residues."}, {"type": "习题 1.5-1", "label": "收敛半径与边界", "text": "确定下列幂级数的收敛半径和收敛区域：\n\n(1) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(z-1)^n}{n}$；\n\n(2) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}n^nz^n$；\n\n(3) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(1-\\frac1n)^n(z-i)^n$；\n\n(4) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n!}{n^n}z^n$。 根值或比值求半径 → 圆内外结论 → 在边界代入 → 通项判别优先，必要时 Dirichlet 或 Stirling。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.5-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.5-1", "labelEn": "Radius of convergence and boundary points", "textEn": "Find the radius and region of convergence of each power series:\n\n(1) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(z-1)^n}{n}$;\n\n(2) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}n^nz^n$;\n\n(3) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(1-\\frac1n)^n(z-i)^n$;\n\n(4) $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n!}{n^n}z^n$. Use root or ratio test for the radius → state inside/outside behavior → substitute boundary points → test the terms first, then use Dirichlet or Stirling when needed."}, {"type": "习题 1.5-2", "label": "指定中心的 Taylor 展开", "text": "在给定中心 $z_0$ 附近展开为 Taylor 级数，并给出圆域半径：\n\n(1) $e^z,z_0=0$；(2) $\\sin z,z_0=0$；(3) $\\cosh z,z_0=0$；\n\n(4) $z/(z^2+4),z_0=0$；(5) $1/[z(z-1)],z_0=i$；\n\n(6) $\\sin z/(1-z),z_0=0$；(7) $1/(z^2+1),z_0=1$。 移中心 → 因式分解或标准级数 → 几何级数/Cauchy乘积 → 取所有局部条件的交集 → 用最近奇点验证最大半径。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.5-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.5-2", "labelEn": "Taylor expansions at specified centers", "textEn": "Expand about the specified center $z_0$ and give the convergence radius:\n\n(1) $e^z,z_0=0$; (2) $\\sin z,z_0=0$; (3) $\\cosh z,z_0=0$;\n\n(4) $z/(z^2+4),z_0=0$; (5) $1/[z(z-1)],z_0=i$;\n\n(6) $\\sin z/(1-z),z_0=0$; (7) $1/(z^2+1),z_0=1$. Shift the center → factor or use standard series → use geometric series or a Cauchy product → intersect all local conditions → verify the maximal radius with the nearest singularity."}, {"type": "习题 1.5-3", "label": "指定环域的 Laurent 展开", "text": "在指定区域展开为 Laurent 级数：\n\n(1) $1/(4z-z^2)$，$0<|z|<4$；\n\n(2) $z^2\\sin(1/z^2)$，$|z|>0$；\n\n(3) $1/(1+z)$，$|z|>1$；\n\n(4) $z/[(z-1)(z-3)]$，$|z-2|>1$；\n\n(5) $e^z/[z(z^2+1)]$，$0<|z|<1$；\n\n(6) $z/(z^2-3z+2)$，$0<|z-1|<1$ 和原书写的 $|z|>1$。 定位中心及各极点半径 → 拆分 → 对每一分母选择小变量（$z/a$或$a/z$） → 写出严格不等式。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.5-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.5-3", "labelEn": "Laurent expansions in specified annuli", "textEn": "Expand into Laurent series in the specified regions:\n\n(1) $1/(4z-z^2)$, $0<|z|<4$;\n\n(2) $z^2\\sin(1/z^2)$, $|z|>0$;\n\n(3) $1/(1+z)$, $|z|>1$;\n\n(4) $z/[(z-1)(z-3)]$, $|z-2|>1$;\n\n(5) $e^z/[z(z^2+1)]$, $0<|z|<1$;\n\n(6) $z/(z^2-3z+2)$, $0<|z-1|<1$ and the textbook's stated region $|z|>1$. Find the center and singularity radii → split fractions → choose a small variable for each denominator, $z/a$ or $a/z$ → state strict convergence inequalities."}, {"type": "习题 1.5-4", "label": "所有最大收敛环域", "text": "以指定 $z_0$ 为中心，在所有可能区域展开：\n\n(1) $1/(z^2+z+1)$，$z_0=0$；\n\n(2) $z/(z^2-5z+4)$，$z_0=2$；\n\n(3) $1/[(z-1)(z+2i)]$，$z_0=0$；\n\n(4) $(z^2-2z+5)/[(z-2)(z^2+1)]$，$z_0=0$。 极点列表 → 距离排序去重 → 列出最大圆域/环域 → 每域逐分母决定正幂或负幂。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.5-4", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.5-4", "labelEn": "All maximal convergence annuli", "textEn": "Expand in every possible region about the specified $z_0$:\n\n(1) $1/(z^2+z+1)$, $z_0=0$;\n\n(2) $z/(z^2-5z+4)$, $z_0=2$;\n\n(3) $1/[(z-1)(z+2i)]$, $z_0=0$;\n\n(4) $(z^2-2z+5)/[(z-2)(z^2+1)]$, $z_0=0$. List poles → sort distinct distances → list maximal disks and annuli → choose positive or negative powers separately for each denominator in each region."}, {"type": "习题 1.5-5", "label": "孤立奇点分类", "text": "找出有限远奇点并分类：\n\n(1) $e^z/(z^2+9)$；(2) $\\sin[1/(z-1)]$；(3) $\\sin z/z$；(4) $z^2e^{1/z}$。 先查全部候选奇点 → 局部约分/展开 → 无负幂可去、有限主部极点、无限主部本性。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.5-5", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.5-5", "labelEn": "Classifying isolated singularities", "textEn": "Find and classify the finite singularities:\n\n(1) $e^z/(z^2+9)$; (2) $\\sin[1/(z-1)]$; (3) $\\sin z/z$; (4) $z^2e^{1/z}$. Find all candidate singularities → cancel or expand locally → no negative powers means removable; a finite principal part means a pole; an infinite principal part means essential."}, {"type": "习题 1.6-1", "label": "从 Laurent 系数求留数", "text": "求下列函数在 $z=0$ 处的留数：\n\n(1) $1/(z+z^2)$；(2) $z\\cos(1/z)$；(3) $(z-\\sin z)/z$；\n\n(4) $(e^{iaz}-e^{ibz})/z^2$；(5) $\\cot z/z^3$；(6) $z^2\\exp(1/z)$。 把目标幂次对齐到 $-1$ → 只保留贡献该幂的项 → 相加；本性奇点同样可以有有限留数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.6-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.6-1", "labelEn": "Residues from Laurent coefficients", "textEn": "Find each residue at $z=0$:\n\n(1) $1/(z+z^2)$; (2) $z\\cos(1/z)$; (3) $(z-\\sin z)/z$;\n\n(4) $(e^{iaz}-e^{ibz})/z^2$; (5) $\\cot z/z^3$; (6) $z^2\\exp(1/z)$. Identify which original term becomes $-1$ → keep only terms contributing that power → add their coefficients. An essential singularity can still have a finite residue."}, {"type": "习题 1.6-2", "label": "闭路积分与极点筛选", "text": "利用留数定理计算（圆周均按正向）：\n\n(1) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\frac{2z+1}{2z^2-z}\\,dz$；\n\n(2) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\sin(1/z)\\,dz$；\n\n(3) $\\oint_{|z|=2}\\frac{\\sinh z}{z^4(1-z^2)}\\,dz$；\n\n(4) $\\oint_{|z|=2}\\frac{e^{-z}}{(z-1)^2}\\,dz$；\n\n(5) $\\oint_{|z-3|=1}\\frac{e^z}{z^2(z^2-9)}\\,dz$；\n\n(6) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\frac{dz}{\\sin^2z}$。 画圆并筛极点 → 单极点用分子/分母导数 → 高阶极点用导数或局部级数 → 留数求和乘方向因子。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.6-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.6-2", "labelEn": "Closed-contour integrals and selecting enclosed poles", "textEn": "Evaluate using the residue theorem; all circles are positively oriented:\n\n(1) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\frac{2z+1}{2z^2-z}\\,dz$;\n\n(2) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\sin(1/z)\\,dz$;\n\n(3) $\\oint_{|z|=2}\\frac{\\sinh z}{z^4(1-z^2)}\\,dz$;\n\n(4) $\\oint_{|z|=2}\\frac{e^{-z}}{(z-1)^2}\\,dz$;\n\n(5) $\\oint_{|z-3|=1}\\frac{e^z}{z^2(z^2-9)}\\,dz$;\n\n(6) $\\oint_{|z|=1}\\frac{dz}{\\sin^2z}$. Draw the circle and select poles → for simple poles use numerator divided by denominator derivative → for higher orders use derivatives or local series → sum residues and apply the orientation factor."}, {"type": "习题 1.6-3", "label": "有限与无穷远留数", "text": "求所有孤立奇点（包括无穷远点）处的留数：\n\n(1) $\\sin(3z)/(z+1)^2$；\n\n(2) $e^{1/z}/[z^2(z^2+4)]$；\n\n(3) $(z+1)/(z^2-2z)$；\n\n(4) $z^3\\cos[1/(z-2)]$；\n\n(5) $z/(1/2-\\sin^2z)$；\n\n(6) $z^{2n}/(z+1)^n$，$n$ 为正整数。 列出全部有限奇点 → 局部算留数 → 先验证无穷远孤立性 → 外域取系数或适用留数和定理 → 检查总和。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.6-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.6-3", "labelEn": "Finite residues and the residue at infinity", "textEn": "Find the residues at all isolated singularities, including infinity:\n\n(1) $\\sin(3z)/(z+1)^2$;\n\n(2) $e^{1/z}/[z^2(z^2+4)]$;\n\n(3) $(z+1)/(z^2-2z)$;\n\n(4) $z^3\\cos[1/(z-2)]$;\n\n(5) $z/(1/2-\\sin^2z)$;\n\n(6) $z^{2n}/(z+1)^n$, with $n$ a positive integer. List all finite singularities → calculate local residues → verify that infinity is isolated → extract an exterior coefficient or use the residue-sum theorem when applicable → check the total."}, {"type": "习题 1.7-1", "label": "有理函数实积分与主值", "text": "用留数定理计算：\n\n(1) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2+1}$；\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x^2+1)(x^2+4)}$；\n\n(3) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{x^4+1}$；\n\n(4) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2+3x+2}$；\n\n(5) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x^2-9)(x^2+4)^2}$；\n\n(6) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^6+1}$；\n\n(7) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\,dx}{(x^2-1)(x^2+2x+2)}$；\n\n(8) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^4+9}$。 收敛与实轴极点检查 → 奇偶性 → 选择围道 → 求上半平面留数 → 必要时加实极点半留数 → 取实值并还原半轴系数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.7-1", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.7-1", "labelEn": "Rational real integrals and principal values", "textEn": "Evaluate using the residue theorem:\n\n(1) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2+1}$;\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x^2+1)(x^2+4)}$;\n\n(3) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{x^4+1}$;\n\n(4) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^2+3x+2}$;\n\n(5) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^2\\,dx}{(x^2-9)(x^2+4)^2}$;\n\n(6) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^6+1}$;\n\n(7) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\,dx}{(x^2-1)(x^2+2x+2)}$;\n\n(8) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x^4+9}$. Check convergence and real poles → use parity → choose the contour → find upper-half-plane residues → add real-pole half-residue terms if needed → obtain a real value and restore any half-line factor."}, {"type": "习题 1.7-2", "label": "振荡积分与指数围道", "text": "用留数定理计算：\n\n(1) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos2x}{(x^2+4)^2}\\,dx$；\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\,dx$；\n\n(3) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin^2x}{x^2}\\,dx$；\n\n(4) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\sin2x}{x^2+3}\\,dx$；\n\n(5) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos x}{(x^2+9)(x^2+4)}\\,dx$；\n\n(6) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin2x}{x^2+4x+5}\\,dx$；\n\n(7) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+2x+2}\\,dx$；\n\n(8) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x+1)\\cos x}{x^2+4x+5}\\,dx$；\n\n(9) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin x}{(x+4)^2+9}\\,dx$。 正弦余弦换指数 → 频率正负决定闭合方向 → 精确找上极点 → 留数计算 → 实部/虚部 → 偶性决定是否除2。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.7-2", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.7-2", "labelEn": "Oscillatory integrals and exponential contours", "textEn": "Evaluate using the residue theorem:\n\n(1) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos2x}{(x^2+4)^2}\\,dx$;\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\,dx$;\n\n(3) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin^2x}{x^2}\\,dx$;\n\n(4) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\sin2x}{x^2+3}\\,dx$;\n\n(5) $\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{\\cos x}{(x^2+9)(x^2+4)}\\,dx$;\n\n(6) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin2x}{x^2+4x+5}\\,dx$;\n\n(7) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+2x+2}\\,dx$;\n\n(8) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{(x+1)\\cos x}{x^2+4x+5}\\,dx$;\n\n(9) $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\frac{\\sin x}{(x+4)^2+9}\\,dx$. Replace sine or cosine by an exponential → choose the closing half-plane from the frequency sign → locate upper poles precisely → compute residues → select real or imaginary part → check evenness before halving."}, {"type": "习题 1.7-3", "label": "单位圆围道与三角积分", "text": "利用留数定理计算：\n\n(1) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{d\\theta}{5+4\\sin\\theta}$；\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{d\\theta}{1+\\sin^2\\theta}$；\n\n(3) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\cos^2(3\\theta)}{5-4\\cos2\\theta}\\,d\\theta$；\n\n(4) $\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{d\\theta}{1+\\cos^2\\theta}$；\n\n(5) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{3+2\\cos\\theta}\\,d\\theta$；\n\n(6) $\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^{2n}\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。 检查周期和对称性 → $z=e^{i\\theta}$ → 把正弦余弦化为 $z,z^{-1}$ → 单位圆内极点筛选 → 只取 $z^{-1}$ 系数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.7-3", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.7-3", "labelEn": "Unit-circle contours and trigonometric integrals", "textEn": "Evaluate using the residue theorem:\n\n(1) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{d\\theta}{5+4\\sin\\theta}$;\n\n(2) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{d\\theta}{1+\\sin^2\\theta}$;\n\n(3) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\cos^2(3\\theta)}{5-4\\cos2\\theta}\\,d\\theta$;\n\n(4) $\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{d\\theta}{1+\\cos^2\\theta}$;\n\n(5) $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{3+2\\cos\\theta}\\,d\\theta$;\n\n(6) $\\int_0^\\pi\\sin^{2n}\\theta\\,d\\theta$, $n\\in\\mathbb N$. Check period and symmetry → set $z=e^{i\\theta}$ → express sine and cosine through $z,z^{-1}$ → select poles inside the unit circle → extract only the $z^{-1}$ coefficient."}, {"type": "习题 1.7-4", "label": "扇形围道积分", "text": "利用留数定理证明\n$$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{dx}{x^3+1}=\\frac{2\\pi}{3\\sqrt3}.$$ 分母含 $z^m$ → 试开角 $2\\pi/m$ 扇形 → 两射线相位关系 → 弧估计 → 极点留数。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.7-4", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.7-4", "labelEn": "A sector-contour integral", "textEn": "Use the residue theorem to prove\n$$\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{dx}{x^3+1}=\\frac{2\\pi}{3\\sqrt3}.$$ A denominator containing $z^m$ → try a sector of angle $2\\pi/m$ → relate the two ray phases → bound the arc → calculate the enclosed residue."}, {"type": "习题 1.7-5", "label": "Fresnel 积分", "text": "利用留数定理证明菲涅耳积分\n$$\\int_0^\\infty\\cos(x^2)dx=\\int_0^\\infty\\sin(x^2)dx=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi2}.$$ 振荡指数 $e^{iz^m}$ → 选择使指数变负实数的旋转角 → 围道积分=0 → 严格控制过渡弧 → 高斯/衰减积分求值 → 取实虚部。", "url": "chapter-1.html#ex-1.7-5", "chapter": 1, "typeEn": "Exercise 1.7-5", "labelEn": "Fresnel integrals", "textEn": "Use the residue theorem to prove the Fresnel-integral identities\n$$\\int_0^\\infty\\cos(x^2)dx=\\int_0^\\infty\\sin(x^2)dx=\\frac12\\sqrt{\\frac\\pi2}.$$ For an oscillatory exponential $e^{iz^m}$ → choose an angle making the exponent negative real → use the zero contour integral → control the connecting arc rigorously → evaluate the Gaussian or decaying integral → take real and imaginary parts."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "傅里叶级数：为什么这样做", "text": "把一个周期内的函数投影到正交的正弦、余弦上；每个系数衡量对应频率的成分。端点条件决定用正弦、余弦还是半整数频率。 先看周期，再看奇偶；投影积分最后算。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-2.1-core", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Fourier series: why the method works", "textEn": "Project one period of a function onto orthogonal sines and cosines. Each coefficient measures the amount of one frequency. Endpoint conditions tell us whether to use sine, cosine, or half-integer frequencies. Check the period, then parity. Calculate projection integrals last."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "傅里叶积分变换：为什么这样做", "text": "傅里叶变换把全轴函数分解为连续频率。微分在频域变成乘 $ik$，局部窄脉冲对应宽频谱。本章统一正变换不带系数、逆变换带 $1/(2\\pi)$。 正变换负指数，逆变换正指数；乘积与卷积的 $2\\pi$ 别丢。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-2.2-core", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Fourier transforms: why the method works", "textEn": "The Fourier transform splits a whole-line function into a continuous range of frequencies. Differentiation becomes multiplication by $ik$ in frequency space. A narrow pulse has a broad spectrum. Throughout this chapter, the forward transform has no prefactor and the inverse has $1/(2\\pi)$. Use a negative exponential for the forward transform and a positive one for the inverse. Keep track of $2\\pi$ in product and convolution formulas."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "Fourier 变换的平移、微分与卷积", "text": "变换把空间微分变成代数乘法，把卷积变成乘积。使用性质前，先确认指数正负号和 $2\\pi$ 放在哪一侧。 空间平移加相位；微分乘 ik；卷积变乘积。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-fourier-rules", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Shifts, derivatives, and convolution in Fourier transforms", "textEn": "The transform turns spatial derivatives into algebraic multiplication and convolutions into products. Before using a property, check the exponential sign and which side contains $2\\pi$. A spatial shift adds phase. A derivative multiplies by ik. A convolution becomes a product."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "δ 函数与抽样性质", "text": "$\\delta$ 应看作作用在测试函数上的抽样规则，不能当作普通的“某点等于无穷大”的函数进行逐点运算。单位面积且不断变窄的脉冲可以逼近它。 找根、除导数绝对值、再抽样。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-2.3-core", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "The δ distribution and sampling", "textEn": "Think of $\\delta$ as a sampling rule acting on test functions. It is not an ordinary function that can be manipulated pointwise as “infinite at one point.” Pulses with unit area and shrinking width can approach it. Find the roots → divide by the absolute derivative → sample the remaining function."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "拉普拉斯变换：为什么这样做", "text": "拉普拉斯变换只看 $t\\ge0$，指数衰减因子使更多函数可变换，尤其适合初值问题。导数的变换会自动带入初值。 时间乘 $t$，频域负求导；乘指数，频域平移。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-2.4-core", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Laplace transforms: why the method works", "textEn": "The Laplace transform uses only $t\\ge0$. Its decaying exponential allows a larger class of functions to be transformed and is especially useful for initial-value problems. Transforming a derivative automatically includes the initial values. Multiplication by $t$ in time becomes a negative frequency derivative. Multiplication by an exponential shifts the frequency variable."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "拉普拉斯变换解常微分方程：为什么这样做", "text": "把微分方程连同初值一次性变成代数方程，解出像函数后做部分分式、移位或卷积逆变换。 先写导数变换和初值，再解 $Y$，最后代回核验。", "url": "chapter-2.html#c2-2.5-core", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Laplace solutions of ODEs: why the method works", "textEn": "Transform the differential equation and initial values together into an algebraic equation. Solve for the transformed function, then invert using partial fractions, shifts, or convolution. Write derivative transforms and initial values first → solve for $Y$ → substitute back to check."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-1", "label": "绝对值三角函数", "text": "将下列周期函数展开为傅里叶级数：(1) $f(x)=|\\cos\\pi x|$；(2) $f(x)=\\sin(\\pi x/l)+|\\sin(\\pi x/l)|$，$l>0$。 绝对值分段化 → 找最小周期/奇偶 → 积化和差 → 合并已知频率。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-1", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-1", "labelEn": "Trigonometric functions with absolute values", "textEn": "Expand these periodic functions in Fourier series: (1) $f(x)=|\\cos\\pi x|$; (2) $f(x)=\\sin(\\pi x/l)+|\\sin(\\pi x/l)|$, $l>0$. Remove the absolute value piecewise → find the fundamental period and parity → use product-to-sum → combine known frequencies."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-2", "label": "恒等式与泊松核展开", "text": "将下列周期函数展开为傅里叶级数：(1) $f(x)=\\cos^2x$；(2) $f(x)=1/[1+\\tfrac12\\sin x]$。 低阶三角式先用恒等式；有理三角式尝试相位平移与几何级数核。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-2", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-2", "labelEn": "Identities and a Poisson-kernel expansion", "textEn": "Expand these periodic functions in Fourier series: (1) $f(x)=\\cos^2x$; (2) $f(x)=1/[1+\\tfrac12\\sin x]$. Try identities first for low-degree trigonometric expressions. For rational trigonometric expressions, try a phase shift and a geometric-series kernel."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-3", "label": "周期锯齿波", "text": "$f$ 的周期为 $2l$，在 $[0,2l)$ 上 $f(x)=x$。求傅里叶级数。 全周期积分 → 算平均值 → 分部积分 → 写跳跃点的收敛值。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-3", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-3", "labelEn": "A periodic sawtooth wave", "textEn": "$f$ has period $2l$ and equals $f(x)=x$ on $[0,2l)$. Find its Fourier series. Integrate over a full period → calculate the average → integrate by parts → state the sum at jumps."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-4", "label": "两端第一类条件的正弦展开", "text": "在 $(0,l)$ 上 $f(x)=x$，题给边界条件 $f(0)=f(l)=0$，求相应傅里叶级数。 第一类齐次边界 → 正弦基 → 正交投影 → 单独讨论端点。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-4", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-4", "labelEn": "Sine expansion for zero-value conditions at both ends", "textEn": "On $(0,l)$, let $f(x)=x$. The stated endpoint conditions are $f(0)=f(l)=0$. Find the corresponding Fourier series. Homogeneous value conditions → sine basis → orthogonal projection → discuss endpoints separately."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-5", "label": "两端第二类条件的余弦展开", "text": "在 $(0,l)$ 上 $f(x)=x$，题给 $f^{\\prime}(0)=f^{\\prime}(l)=0$，求相应傅里叶级数。 第二类齐次边界 → 余弦基且保留常数模态 → 分部积分两次。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-5", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-5", "labelEn": "Cosine expansion for zero-derivative conditions at both ends", "textEn": "On $(0,l)$, let $f(x)=x$, with the stated conditions $f^{\\prime}(0)=f^{\\prime}(l)=0$. Find the corresponding Fourier series. Homogeneous derivative conditions → cosine basis, including the constant mode → integrate by parts twice."}, {"type": "习题 2.1-6", "label": "左零导数右零值的混合展开", "text": "在 $(0,l)$ 上 $f(x)=x$，题给 $f^{\\prime}(0)=f(l)=0$，求相应傅里叶级数。 混合边界先解本征值方程，再投影；不要直接套整数频率。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.1-6", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.1-6", "labelEn": "A mixed expansion: zero derivative at the left, zero value at the right", "textEn": "On $(0,l)$, let $f(x)=x$, with the stated conditions $f^{\\prime}(0)=f(l)=0$. Find the corresponding Fourier series. For mixed boundaries, solve the eigenvalue condition before projecting. Do not assume integer frequencies."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-1", "label": "矩形脉冲变换", "text": "$f(x)=1$（$-a\\le x\\le a$），其余为 $0$，$a>0$。求傅里叶变换。 先找支集 → 利用奇偶 → 计算有限区间积分 → 补可去奇点。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-1", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-1", "labelEn": "Transform of a rectangular pulse", "textEn": "Let $f(x)=1$ for $-a\\le x\\le a$ and $0$ elsewhere, with $a>0$. Find its Fourier transform. Locate the support → use parity → integrate over the finite interval → fill in removable singularities."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-2", "label": "sinc与矩形谱的对偶", "text": "求 $f(x)=\\sin(ax)/x$ 的傅里叶变换，并与前题比较（$a>0$，$x=0$ 取连续值 $a$）。 遇到 $\\sin ax/x$ → 矩形谱对偶，或积化和差后用狄利克雷积分。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-2", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-2", "labelEn": "Duality between sinc and a rectangular spectrum", "textEn": "Find the Fourier transform of $f(x)=\\sin(ax)/x$ and compare it with the previous exercise. Assume $a>0$ and take the continuous value $a$ at $x=0$. For $\\sin ax/x$, use rectangular-spectrum duality, or a product-to-sum identity followed by the Dirichlet integral."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-3", "label": "双边指数函数", "text": "求 $f(x)=e^{-|x|}$ 的傅里叶变换。 实偶函数 → 两倍半轴余弦积分 → 复指数求实部。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-3", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-3", "labelEn": "A two-sided exponential", "textEn": "Find the Fourier transform of $f(x)=e^{-|x|}$. Real even function → twice the half-line cosine integral → take the real part of an exponential integral."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-4", "label": "高斯函数的变换", "text": "求 $f(x)=e^{-x^2}$ 的傅里叶变换。 高斯乘多项式 → 频域求导；基础高斯用微分方程或配方。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-4", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-4", "labelEn": "Transform of a Gaussian", "textEn": "Find the Fourier transform of $f(x)=e^{-x^2}$. Gaussian times a polynomial → differentiate in frequency space. Find the basic Gaussian by a differential equation or completing the square."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-5", "label": "有限支集正弦", "text": "$f(x)=\\sin x$（$|x|\\le\\pi$），其余为 $0$。求傅里叶变换。 有限区间三角函数 → 指数拆分/积化和差 → 单独补共振频率值。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-5", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-5", "labelEn": "A sine function with finite support", "textEn": "Let $f(x)=\\sin x$ for $|x|\\le\\pi$ and $0$ elsewhere. Find its Fourier transform. A trigonometric function on a finite interval → split exponentials or use product-to-sum → separately fill in resonant-frequency values."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-6", "label": "半轴零值边界与奇延拓", "text": "在 $(0,\\infty)$ 上，$f(x)=\\cos x$（$0<x\\le\\pi$）、$f(x)=0$（$x>\\pi$），且题给 $f(0)=0$。求相应傅里叶变换像函数。 半轴第一类边界 → 奇延拓 → 正弦积分 → 根据规范补 $-2i$ 或归一化系数。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-6", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-6", "labelEn": "A zero boundary on the half-line and odd extension", "textEn": "On $(0,\\infty)$, let $f(x)=\\cos x$ for $0<x\\le\\pi$ and $f(x)=0$ for $x>\\pi$, with the stated condition $f(0)=0$. Find the corresponding transformed function. Half-line value boundary → odd extension → sine integral → insert $-2i$ or the normalization factor required by the convention."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-7", "label": "三维汤川势", "text": "求三维空间汤川势 $U(r)=e^{-\\alpha r}/r$ 的傅里叶变换（取 $\\alpha>0$，$r=|\\mathbf r|$）。提示：用球坐标。 三维径向函数 → 以 $\\mathbf k$ 为极轴 → 角积分化为 sinc → 一维径向积分。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-7", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-7", "labelEn": "The three-dimensional Yukawa potential", "textEn": "Find the three-dimensional Fourier transform of the Yukawa potential $U(r)=e^{-\\alpha r}/r$, assuming $\\alpha>0$ and $r=|\\mathbf r|$. Hint: use spherical coordinates. A radial function in three dimensions → choose $\\mathbf k$ as polar axis → reduce the angular integral to sinc → evaluate the one-dimensional radial integral."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-8", "label": "三维反平方径向函数", "text": "求三维空间 $f(r)=1/r^2$ 的傅里叶变换。 慢衰减径向函数 → 加指数阻尼 → 计算 → 取 Abel 极限。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-8", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-8", "labelEn": "An inverse-square radial function in three dimensions", "textEn": "Find the three-dimensional Fourier transform of $f(r)=1/r^2$. A slowly decaying radial function → insert exponential damping → calculate → take the Abel limit."}, {"type": "习题 2.2-9", "label": "库仑势的三维频谱", "text": "求库仑势 $U(r)=1/r$ 的傅里叶变换，并与前题比较。提示：看作汤川势 $\\alpha=0$ 的极限。 不绝对可积的库仑核 → 汤川正则化 → 参数趋零 → 检查缩放幂次。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.2-9", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.2-9", "labelEn": "The three-dimensional Coulomb spectrum", "textEn": "Find the Fourier transform of the Coulomb potential $U(r)=1/r$ and compare with the previous exercise. Hint: take the $\\alpha=0$ limit of the Yukawa potential. A non-absolutely-integrable Coulomb kernel → Yukawa regularization → let the parameter tend to zero → check the scaling power."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-1", "label": "帕塞瓦尔计算sinc平方积分", "text": "利用帕塞瓦尔定理计算 $I=\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sin^2x/x^2\\,dx$。 平方型积分 → 找简单函数的频谱 → 套帕塞瓦尔 → 检查归一化。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-1", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-1", "labelEn": "A squared-sinc integral using Parseval", "textEn": "Use Parseval's theorem to evaluate $I=\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sin^2x/x^2\\,dx$. An integral of a square → find a simple function with this spectrum → use Parseval → check normalization."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-2", "label": "矩形脉冲逼近delta", "text": "$f_h(x)=1/h$（$|x|\\le h/2$），其余为 $0$。证明 $h\\to0^+$ 时 $f_h\\to\\delta$。 近似单位核证明 → 归一面积 → 测试函数换元 → 连续性取极限。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-2", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-2", "labelEn": "Rectangular pulses approaching delta", "textEn": "Let $f_h(x)=1/h$ for $|x|\\le h/2$ and $0$ elsewhere. Prove that as $h\\to0^+$, $f_h\\to\\delta$. An approximate-identity proof → check unit area → change variables against a test function → use continuity for the limit."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-3", "label": "二维delta积分", "text": "计算 $\\int_0^1\\int_0^1\\delta(x+y-1)dxdy$。 多维delta → 先固定其他变量找到单变量根 → 除导数绝对值 → 再积分。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-3", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-3", "labelEn": "A two-dimensional delta integral", "textEn": "Evaluate $\\int_0^1\\int_0^1\\delta(x+y-1)dxdy$. A multidimensional delta → fix the other variables and find a one-variable root → divide by the absolute derivative → finish the remaining integral."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-4", "label": "符号函数的广义变换", "text": "$\\operatorname{sgn}x=1$（$x>0$）、$-1$（$x<0$）。求傅里叶变换。 非衰减函数 → 指数正则化或分布导数 → 用奇偶性定可能的delta项。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-4", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-4", "labelEn": "Generalized transform of the sign function", "textEn": "Let $\\operatorname{sgn}x=1$ for $x>0$ and $-1$ for $x<0$. Find its Fourier transform. A nondecaying function → exponential regularization or distributional differentiation → use parity to determine possible delta terms."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-5", "label": "乘积的傅里叶变换", "text": "已知 $\\mathcal F[f]=F$、$\\mathcal F[g]=G$。证明 $\\mathcal F[fg]=(F*G)/(2\\pi)$，其中 $(F*G)(k)=\\int F(k_1)G(k-k_1)dk_1$。 乘积变换证明 → 展开一个逆变换 → Fubini换序 → 认出另一个变换。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-5", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-5", "labelEn": "Fourier transform of a product", "textEn": "Given $\\mathcal F[f]=F$ and $\\mathcal F[g]=G$, prove $\\mathcal F[fg]=(F*G)/(2\\pi)$, where $(F*G)(k)=\\int F(k_1)G(k-k_1)dk_1$. To transform a product → expand one inverse transform → interchange using Fubini → recognize the other transform."}, {"type": "习题 2.3-6", "label": "因果正弦的广义频谱", "text": "求 $f(x)=h(x)\\sin(\\omega x)$ 的傅里叶变换，其中 $h$ 是单位阶跃函数。 阶跃截断谐波 → 阻尼保证收敛 → 频移 → 同时保留主值项和delta项。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.3-6", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.3-6", "labelEn": "Generalized spectrum of a causal sine", "textEn": "Find the Fourier transform of $f(x)=h(x)\\sin(\\omega x)$, where $h$ is the unit step function. A step-truncated harmonic → damp it for convergence → apply frequency shifts → retain both principal-value and delta terms."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-1", "label": "正弦的拉普拉斯变换", "text": "求 $\\sin(at)$ 的拉普拉斯变换。 三角函数 → 指数拆分 → 两个简单分式合并。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-1", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-1", "labelEn": "Laplace transform of sine", "textEn": "Find the Laplace transform of $\\sin(at)$. A trigonometric function → split into exponentials → combine two simple fractions."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-2", "label": "双曲正弦与余弦", "text": "求 $\\sinh(at)$ 和 $\\cosh(at)$ 的拉普拉斯变换。 双曲函数拆实指数 → 分别变换 → 检查最强增长率。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-2", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-2", "labelEn": "Hyperbolic sine and cosine", "textEn": "Find the Laplace transforms of $\\sinh(at)$ and $\\cosh(at)$. Split into real exponentials → transform each → check the largest growth rate."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-3", "label": "时间乘t的性质", "text": "求 $t\\cos(at)$ 的拉普拉斯变换。 $t^nf(t)$ 的变换 → $(-1)^n$ 对像函数求 $n$ 阶导数。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-3", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-3", "labelEn": "The time-multiplication property", "textEn": "Find the Laplace transform of $t\\cos(at)$. For the transform of $t^nf(t)$ → apply $(-1)^n$ times the $n$th derivative to the transformed function."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-4", "label": "指数平移", "text": "求 $e^{bt}\\sin(at)$ 和 $e^{bt}\\cosh(at)$ 的拉普拉斯变换。 指数乘法 → 整个像函数统一平移 → 同时平移收敛域。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-4", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-4", "labelEn": "Exponential shift", "textEn": "Find the Laplace transforms of $e^{bt}\\sin(at)$ and $e^{bt}\\cosh(at)$. Multiplication by an exponential → shift the entire transformed function → shift the convergence region too."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-5", "label": "拉普拉斯逆变换", "text": "求像函数的原函数：(1) $(p-2)/[(p-2)^2+4]$；(2) $-1/[p^2(p-1)]$。 先识别标准像；不能直接识别时分解成简单极点/重极点。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-5", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-5", "labelEn": "Inverse Laplace transforms", "textEn": "Find the original functions: (1) $(p-2)/[(p-2)^2+4]$; (2) $-1/[p^2(p-1)]$. Recognize a standard transform first. If that fails, decompose into simple or repeated poles."}, {"type": "习题 2.4-6", "label": "拉普拉斯积分定理", "text": "证明 $\\mathcal L[\\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau]=F(p)/p$。 时间积分定理 → 定义中换积分次序，或利用零初值的导数关系。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.4-6", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.4-6", "labelEn": "The Laplace integration theorem", "textEn": "Prove $\\mathcal L[\\int_0^t f(\\tau)d\\tau]=F(p)/p$. For a time-integral theorem → interchange integrals in the definition, or use a derivative relation with zero initial value."}, {"type": "习题 2.5-1", "label": "二阶非齐次初值问题", "text": "解 $y^{\\prime\\prime}+2y^{\\prime}-3y=e^{-t}$（$t>0$），$y(0)=0,y^{\\prime}(0)=1$。 写初值修正 → 解有理像函数 → 分式 → 逆变换 → 初值与方程双检。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.5-1", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.5-1", "labelEn": "A second-order nonhomogeneous initial-value problem", "textEn": "Solve $y^{\\prime\\prime}+2y^{\\prime}-3y=e^{-t}$ for $t>0$, with $y(0)=0,y^{\\prime}(0)=1$. Include initial-value corrections → solve the rational transformed equation → use partial fractions → invert → check both initial values and the equation."}, {"type": "习题 2.5-2", "label": "常量驱动振子", "text": "解 $y^{\\prime\\prime}+y=2$（$t>0$），$y(0)=0,y^{\\prime}(0)=1$。 常量驱动 → $1/p$ → 识别 $1/[p(p^2+\\omega^2)]$。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.5-2", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.5-2", "labelEn": "An oscillator with constant forcing", "textEn": "Solve $y^{\\prime\\prime}+y=2$ for $t>0$, with $y(0)=0,y^{\\prime}(0)=1$. Constant forcing → $1/p$ → recognize $1/[p(p^2+\\omega^2)]$."}, {"type": "习题 2.5-3", "label": "含参数振子三种情形", "text": "用拉普拉斯变换解 $y^{\\prime\\prime}+\\lambda y=0$（$t>0$），$y(0)=a,y^{\\prime}(0)=b$。 参数二阶方程 → 先统一像函数 → 按分母根类型分类逆变换。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.5-3", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.5-3", "labelEn": "Three parameter regimes of an oscillator", "textEn": "Use Laplace transforms to solve $y^{\\prime\\prime}+\\lambda y=0$ for $t>0$, with $y(0)=a,y^{\\prime}(0)=b$. A parameter-dependent second-order equation → obtain one transformed formula → classify the inverse by denominator-root type."}, {"type": "习题 2.5-4", "label": "有限时长外力", "text": "解 $y^{\\prime\\prime}+4y=f(t)$，$y(0)=1,y^{\\prime}(0)=0$，其中 $f(t)=1$（$0<t<t_0$）、$0$（$t>t_0$），$t_0>0$。 分段外力 → 阶跃差 → 解像函数 → 延迟响应相减 → 检查接续。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.5-4", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.5-4", "labelEn": "A force acting for a finite time", "textEn": "Solve $y^{\\prime\\prime}+4y=f(t)$ with $y(0)=1,y^{\\prime}(0)=0$, where $f(t)=1$ for $0<t<t_0$ and $0$ for $t>t_0$, with $t_0>0$. Piecewise force → difference of steps → solve in transform space → subtract the delayed response → check joining conditions."}, {"type": "习题 2.5-5", "label": "耦合微分方程组", "text": "解方程组 $y^{\\prime\\prime}-x^{\\prime\\prime}+x^{\\prime}-y=e^t-2$，$2y^{\\prime\\prime}-x^{\\prime\\prime}-2y^{\\prime}+x=-t$，初值 $x(0)=x^{\\prime}(0)=y(0)=y^{\\prime}(0)=0$。 耦合线性常系数系统 → 拉普拉斯代数化 → 二元消元 → 分式逆变换 → 两方程逐一核验。", "url": "chapter-2.html#ex-2.5-5", "chapter": 2, "typeEn": "Exercise 2.5-5", "labelEn": "A coupled system of differential equations", "textEn": "Solve $y^{\\prime\\prime}-x^{\\prime\\prime}+x^{\\prime}-y=e^t-2$ and $2y^{\\prime\\prime}-x^{\\prime\\prime}-2y^{\\prime}+x=-t$ with initial values $x(0)=x^{\\prime}(0)=y(0)=y^{\\prime}(0)=0$. A coupled constant-coefficient linear system → transform into algebra → eliminate two unknowns → invert partial fractions → check each original equation."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "波动问题：方程与边界一起看", "text": "波动方程来自“质量×加速度＝受力”。弦横振动波速为 $c=\\sqrt{T/\\rho}$，杆纵振动波速为 $c=\\sqrt{Y/\\rho}$。固定端给位移条件，自由端给应力或斜率条件。 位移决定余弦时间项，速度决定正弦时间项；边界先于系数。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-3.1-core", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Wave problems: read the equation and boundary conditions together", "textEn": "The wave equation comes from “mass × acceleration = force.” A string’s transverse wave speed is $c=\\sqrt{T/\\rho}$; a rod’s longitudinal wave speed is $c=\\sqrt{Y/\\rho}$. A fixed end prescribes displacement. A free end prescribes stress or slope. Displacement supplies cosine-in-time terms; velocity supplies sine-in-time terms. Choose the boundary-compatible modes before finding coefficients."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "达朗贝尔公式与特征线", "text": "无限弦的位移由两个反向传播的波叠加。初速度不是直接乘 t，而是在影响区间上积分。固定端半轴问题可以先奇延拓。 位移取两端平均；速度取中间面积除 2c。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-dalambert", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "D’Alembert’s formula and characteristics", "textEn": "An infinite string’s displacement is the sum of waves traveling in opposite directions. Initial velocity contributes an integral over the region of influence, rather than simply velocity multiplied by t. A fixed-end half-line can be handled by odd extension. Average the displacement at the two endpoints; integrate the velocity between them and divide by 2c."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "非齐次方程的模态方程与共振", "text": "空间边界齐次后，把外力和初值投影到相同本征函数上。每个模态都是一个受迫振子，共振时不能使用零分母的非共振公式。 空间先正交投影，时间再解振子；遇零分母先检查共振。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-forcing", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Modal equations for forcing and resonance", "textEn": "Once spatial boundary conditions are homogeneous, project the forcing and initial data onto the same eigenfunctions. Each mode is a forced oscillator. At resonance, the nonresonant formula has a zero denominator and must be replaced. Project in space first, then solve the oscillator in time. A zero denominator means check resonance."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "输运问题：方程与边界一起看", "text": "热量守恒与傅里叶导热定律给热方程。无源热方程的各非零空间模态随时间指数衰减；保温边界保留零模态，固定零温边界没有零模态。 热方程时间一阶，初值只要一个；频率越高衰减越快。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-3.2-core", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Transport problems: read the equation and boundary conditions together", "textEn": "Heat conservation and Fourier’s law give the heat equation. Every nonzero spatial mode of the source-free heat equation decays exponentially. Insulated boundaries retain a zero mode; fixed zero-temperature boundaries do not. The heat equation is first order in time and needs one initial condition. Higher spatial frequencies decay faster."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "热核、镜像延拓与扩散尺度", "text": "无限域热核是随时间变宽的 Gaussian。半轴零温用反号镜像，半轴绝热用同号镜像。扩散影响尺度随 $\\sqrt t$ 增长。 热核总量为 1；零值边界相减，零导数边界相加。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-heat-kernel", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "The heat kernel, image extension, and diffusion scale", "textEn": "The infinite-domain heat kernel is a Gaussian that broadens with time. For a zero-temperature half-line boundary, subtract the reflected image. For an insulated boundary, add it. The diffusion scale grows as $\\sqrt t$. The heat kernel has total mass 1. Subtract images for a zero value; add them for a zero derivative."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "非齐次边界先齐次化", "text": "直接分离变量要求齐次边界。先找一个满足边界的简单函数 h，再令 u=v+h。若边界随时间变，v 的方程通常出现新的源项。 边界先减掉；初值也减掉；方程检查是否新增源。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-lifting", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Make nonhomogeneous boundaries homogeneous first", "textEn": "Direct separation of variables needs homogeneous boundaries. First choose a simple function h satisfying the prescribed boundary values, then set u=v+h. If the boundary changes with time, the equation for v usually acquires a new source. Subtract the boundary function. Subtract it from the initial data too. Check whether the equation gains a source."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "稳定场问题：方程与边界一起看", "text": "稳态意味着时间不变，无源场满足拉普拉斯方程。矩形区域分离后，一个方向是三角函数，另一个方向是双曲函数；非齐次边界通过投影确定系数。 先用齐次两边选正交基，再用双曲函数跨到非零边。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-3.3-core", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Steady fields: read the equation and boundaries together", "textEn": "A steady field does not depend on time. A source-free steady field satisfies Laplace’s equation. On a rectangle, separation gives trigonometric functions in one direction and hyperbolic functions in the other. Project the nonzero boundary values to find coefficients. Use two homogeneous sides to choose the orthogonal basis, then a hyperbolic factor to reach the nonzero side."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "Laplace 方程的唯一性与最大值原理", "text": "边界值不仅用来定系数，也决定解是否唯一。判断两种方法的结果是否相同，可以研究两解之差。 两解相减；能量为零；边界定常数。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-uniqueness", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Uniqueness and the maximum principle for Laplace’s equation", "textEn": "Boundary values do more than fix coefficients: they determine whether the solution is unique. To compare results from two methods, study their difference. Subtract two solutions. Zero energy implies a constant. Use the boundary to fix that constant."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "施图姆–刘维尔本征值问题：方程与边界一起看", "text": "不同边界下看似不同的级数，统一来自自伴本征值问题。权函数决定投影内积。实本征值依赖自伴边界；本征值非负还需要能量二次型非负，不能只看微分方程系数。 先配导数项成 $(p y')'$；投影必须乘权函数。", "url": "chapter-3.html#c3-3.4-core", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Sturm–Liouville problems: read the equation and boundaries together", "textEn": "The different series arising from different boundaries all come from self-adjoint eigenvalue problems. The weight function defines the projection inner product. Self-adjoint boundaries ensure real eigenvalues. Nonnegative eigenvalues additionally require a nonnegative energy quadratic form; the differential-equation coefficients alone do not guarantee this. First combine the derivative terms into $(p y')'$. Always include the weight when projecting."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-1", "label": "四分之一点拉弦后释放", "text": "长 $l$、线密度 $\\rho$、张力 $T$ 的均匀弦，两端 $x=0,l$ 固定。在 $x=l/4$ 用微小横向力 $F$（$F\\ll T$）拉至静止后放手。(1)建立完整定解问题；(2)用分离变量法求振动。 静态拉弦 → 斜率差平衡求三角初形 → 正弦投影 → 零初速只留时间余弦。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-1", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-1", "labelEn": "Pluck and release a string at its quarter point", "textEn": "A uniform string has length $l$, linear density $\\rho$, tension $T$, and fixed ends $x=0,l$. A small transverse force $F$ ($F\\ll T$) pulls it at $x=l/4$ until it is at rest, then is released. (1) Formulate the complete problem. (2) Solve by separation of variables. Static pull → slope-jump balance gives the triangular initial shape → sine projection → zero initial velocity retains only cosine-in-time terms."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-2", "label": "一端固定杆压缩后释放", "text": "均匀细杆长 $l$，截面积 $S$，质量密度 $\\rho$，杨氏模量 $Y$。$x=0$ 固定，从 $x=l$ 压至长度 $l(1-2e)$，静止后放手。(1)建立纵振动定解问题；(2)分离变量求解。 杆纵振动 → 杨氏应力 → 固定端/自由端区分 → 半整数频率 → 初始应变投影。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-2", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-2", "labelEn": "Release a compressed rod with one fixed end", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod has length $l$, cross-section $S$, mass density $\\rho$, and Young’s modulus $Y$. The end $x=0$ is fixed. Compress it from $x=l$ to length $l(1-2e)$, bring it to rest, and release it. (1) Formulate its longitudinal-vibration problem. (2) Solve by separation. Longitudinal rod vibration → Young’s stress → distinguish fixed and free ends → half-integer frequencies → project the initial deformation."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-3", "label": "两端自由杆压缩释放", "text": "均匀细杆长 $l$，截面积 $S$，密度 $\\rho$，杨氏模量 $Y$。从两端施压使长度变为 $l(1-2e)$，静止后同时放手。(1)建立定解问题；(2)用分离变量法求解。 自由—自由杆 → 余弦含零模态 → 先固定中心/平均值 → 投影得对称模态。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-3", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-3", "labelEn": "Release a compressed rod with both ends free", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod has length $l$, cross-section $S$, density $\\rho$, and Young’s modulus $Y$. Compress it from both ends to length $l(1-2e)$, bring it to rest, and release both ends simultaneously. (1) Formulate the problem. (2) Solve by separation of variables. Free–free rod → cosine basis including a zero mode → fix the center or mean first → project to find the symmetry-selected modes."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-4", "label": "阻尼弦方程", "text": "均匀弦在阻尼介质中横振动，单位长度所受阻力为 $f=-Ru_t$。弦线密度 $\\rho$，张力 $T$。推导振动方程。 受力微元 → 单位长度统一 → 阻力反向 → 能量衰减核验符号。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-4", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-4", "labelEn": "The damped-string equation", "textEn": "A uniform string oscillates transversely in a damping medium. The resistance per unit length is $f=-Ru_t$. Its linear density is $\\rho$ and tension is $T$. Derive the vibration equation. Segment force balance → consistent per-unit-length terms → resistance opposes velocity → verify the sign using energy decay."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-5", "label": "杆端弹簧的Robin条件", "text": "均匀杆长 $l$，截面积 $S$、密度 $\\rho$、杨氏模量 $Y$。$x=0$ 固定，$x=l$ 接劲度系数 $k$ 的轻弹簧，弹簧另一端固定，平衡时原长。压右端使杆长为 $l(1-2e)$，静止后释放。(1)定解问题；(2)分离变量求解。 端点弹簧 → 力平衡成Robin条件 → 超越方程求谱 → 使用实际范数投影。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-5", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-5", "labelEn": "A Robin condition for a spring at a rod end", "textEn": "A uniform rod has length $l$, cross-section $S$, density $\\rho$, and Young’s modulus $Y$. Its end $x=0$ is fixed. Its end $x=l$ is attached to a light spring of stiffness $k$, with the spring’s other end fixed and its equilibrium length unstretched. Compress the rod from the right to length $l(1-2e)$, bring it to rest, and release it. (1) Formulate the problem. (2) Solve by separation. End spring → force balance gives a Robin condition → solve the transcendental spectrum equation → project using the actual squared norm."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-6", "label": "悬垂重绳的变张力方程", "text": "长 $l$、均匀密度 $\\rho$ 的柔软重绳，一端固定悬挂，另一端自由。推导相对于平衡位置的小横振动方程。 重绳 → 截取下段求平衡张力 → $(Tu_x)_x$ → 明确坐标方向与自然端点。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-6", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-6", "labelEn": "Variable tension in a hanging heavy rope", "textEn": "A flexible rope of length $l$ and uniform density $\\rho$ hangs from a fixed end with its other end free. Derive its small transverse-vibration equation about equilibrium. Heavy rope → use the lower segment’s weight to find equilibrium tension → retain $(Tu_x)_x$ → specify the coordinate direction and natural endpoint condition."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-7", "label": "旋转轻绳与横振动方向", "text": "长 $l$、均匀密度 $\\rho$ 的柔软轻绳，一端固定在竖直转轴上，另一端自由，转轴带绳以角速度 $\\omega$ 转动。推导相对于平衡水平线的小横振动方程。 旋转绳 → 外段向心力积分 → 明确观察坐标和振动方向 → 张力散度与惯性项。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-7", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-7", "labelEn": "A rotating light rope: specify the transverse direction", "textEn": "A flexible light rope has length $l$ and uniform density $\\rho$. One end is fixed to a vertical rotating axis and the other is free. The axis rotates the rope with angular speed $\\omega$. Derive the small transverse-vibration equation about the equilibrium horizontal line. Rotating rope → integrate outer-segment centripetal force → specify frame and vibration direction → combine tension divergence and inertia."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-8", "label": "弦上集中质量的衔接条件", "text": "两端固定、长 $l$ 的均匀柔软弦，在内部点 $x_0$ 挂质量 $m$ 的砝码。确定小横振动时该点衔接条件。 集中元件 → 连续位移 → 跨点动量平衡 → 用惯性替代常规斜率连续。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-8", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-8", "labelEn": "Matching conditions at a point mass on a string", "textEn": "A uniform flexible string of length $l$ is fixed at both ends and carries a mass $m$ at an interior point $x_0$. Find the matching conditions there during small transverse motion. Concentrated component → continuous displacement → momentum balance across the point → replace ordinary slope continuity by an inertia relation."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-9", "label": "有限宽度锤击弦", "text": "长 $l$、线密度 $\\rho$、两端固定的弦初始在平衡位置。宽 $2\\delta$ 的锤瞬间敲击 $[x_0-\\delta,x_0+\\delta]$，使弦获得总冲量 $I$。(1)定解问题；(2)分离变量求振动规律。 瞬时冲量 → $\\rho v=j$ → 正弦投影初速度 → 再除模态频率 → 检查点冲量极限。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-9", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-9", "labelEn": "A finite-width hammer strike on a string", "textEn": "A uniform string of length $l$ and linear density $\\rho$, fixed at both ends, starts in equilibrium. A hammer of width $2\\delta$ instantaneously strikes $[x_0-\\delta,x_0+\\delta]$, giving total impulse $I$. (1) Formulate the problem. (2) Find the motion by separation. Instantaneous impulse → $\\rho v=j$ → sine-project velocity → divide by modal frequency → check the point-impulse limit."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-10", "label": "正方形膜的双重正弦解", "text": "边长 $a$ 的均匀正方形膜四边固定，初始位移 $\\varphi(x,y)$，初始速度 $v(x,y)$。求二维横振动规律。 二维分离 → 两个空间本征值相加 → 双重正交投影 → 初速度系数除频率。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-10", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-10", "labelEn": "A double-sine solution for a square membrane", "textEn": "A uniform square membrane of side $a$ is fixed on all four edges. Its initial displacement is $\\varphi(x,y)$ and initial velocity $v(x,y)$. Find its two-dimensional transverse motion. Separate in two dimensions → add the two spatial eigenvalues → double orthogonal projection → divide the velocity coefficient by frequency."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-11", "label": "单空间模态受迫弦", "text": "长 $l$、两端固定的均匀弦，单位长度持续外力 $f(x,t)=A\\sin(2\\pi x/l)\\sin\\omega t$。弦从平衡位置静止开始，求受迫振动。 空间外力为单本征函数 → 仅一个模态ODE → 特解加瞬态 → 单列共振。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-11", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-11", "labelEn": "A forced string with one spatial mode", "textEn": "A uniform string of length $l$, fixed at both ends, experiences a sustained force per unit length $f(x,t)=A\\sin(2\\pi x/l)\\sin\\omega t$. Starting at rest in equilibrium, find its forced motion. A single spatial eigenfunction in the force → one modal ODE → particular solution plus transient → treat resonance separately."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-12", "label": "点力驱动固定弦", "text": "长 $l$、两端固定的均匀弦在 $x_0$ 点受持续横向力 $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$，从平衡位置静止开始。求受迫振动。 点源delta → 抽样得到模态力 → 独立受迫ODE → 节点选择与共振判定。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-12", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-12", "labelEn": "A fixed-end string driven by a point force", "textEn": "A uniform string of length $l$ is fixed at both ends. A sustained transverse force $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$ acts at $x_0$. Starting at rest in equilibrium, find the forced motion. Point-source delta → sample the mode shape to obtain modal force → independent forced ODEs → check nodes and resonance."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-13", "label": "端力驱动固定—自由杆", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀细杆，一端固定，另一端受到持续外力 $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$。杆从平衡位置静止开始，求受迫纵振动。 边界受迫 → 先写应力边界 → 弱投影或边界齐次化 → 端值决定模态力 → 共振。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-13", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-13", "labelEn": "End-force driving of a fixed–free rod", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod of length $l$ has one fixed end and a sustained force $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$ at the other. Starting at rest in equilibrium, find its forced longitudinal motion. Boundary forcing → write the stress boundary first → weak projection or boundary lifting → endpoint values give modal forces → check resonance."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-14", "label": "无限弦点冲量", "text": "无限长均匀弦初始在平衡位置静止，在 $t=0$、$x=x_0$ 点受总冲量 $I$。求此无限弦振动。 点冲量 → delta初速度 → 达朗贝尔区间积分 → 判断冲点是否在特征区间。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-14", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-14", "labelEn": "A point impulse on an infinite string", "textEn": "An infinite uniform string starts at rest in equilibrium. At $t=0$, a total impulse $I$ acts at $x=x_0$. Find its motion. Point impulse → delta initial velocity → integrate over the d’Alembert interval → decide whether the impact point is inside the characteristic interval."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-15", "label": "一般半无限弦的非齐次端位移", "text": "完整求解教材式(3.1.161)：$u_{tt}-c^2u_{xx}=0$（$x>0,t>0$），$u(x,0)=\\varphi(x)$，$u_t(x,0)=v(x)$，$u(0,t)=g(t)$。 半轴非齐次位移边界 → 叠加 → 初值奇延拓反射 → 边界信号延迟传播 → 检查角点相容。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-15", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-15", "labelEn": "A general half-infinite string with prescribed end displacement", "textEn": "Fully solve textbook equation (3.1.161): $u_{tt}-c^2u_{xx}=0$ for $x>0,t>0$, $u(x,0)=\\varphi(x)$, $u_t(x,0)=v(x)$, and $u(0,t)=g(t)$. Nonhomogeneous displacement at a half-line boundary → superpose → odd extension reflects initial data → delayed propagation carries the boundary signal → check corner compatibility."}, {"type": "习题 3.1-16", "label": "半无限弦端点正弦外力", "text": "半无限均匀弦初始位移和初速度均为零，$x=0$ 端受周期外力 $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$。求振动。 半轴端力 → 选择向外行波 → 力与行波导数关系 → 积分一次 → 加到达阶跃。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.1-16", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.1-16", "labelEn": "A sinusoidal end force on a half-infinite string", "textEn": "A half-infinite uniform string has zero initial displacement and velocity. A periodic force $f(t)=A\\sin\\omega t$ acts at its end $x=0$. Find its motion. Half-line end force → choose an outgoing wave → relate force to the wave derivative → integrate once → include the arrival step function."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-1", "label": "通电细杆的热方程与升温", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀金属杆通稳定电流 $I$；截面积 $S$、密度 $\\rho$、比热 $c$、热导率 $k$、电阻率 $r$。侧面绝热，两端温度 $u(0,t)=0,u(l,t)=u_0$，初温 $u(x,0)=u_0x/l$。(1)推导定解问题；(2)分离变量求温度。 带源非齐次边界热方程 → 热平衡定源量纲 → 找稳态 → 齐次化 → 投影初始差值。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-1", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-1", "labelEn": "Heating of a current-carrying rod", "textEn": "A uniform metal rod of length $l$ carries a steady current $I$. It has cross-section $S$, density $\\rho$, specific heat $c$, thermal conductivity $k$, and electrical resistivity $r$. The lateral surface is insulated. Its ends have $u(0,t)=0,u(l,t)=u_0$, and initially $u(x,0)=u_0x/l$. (1) Derive the complete problem. (2) Find temperature by separation. Heat equation with source and nonzero boundaries → use heat balance to fix source units → find the steady state → homogenize → project the initial difference."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-2", "label": "混凝土水化热源", "text": "混凝土浇灌后释放水化热，储存的水化热密度 $Q$ 满足 $dQ/dt=-\\beta Q$。比热 $c$、密度 $\\rho$，初始水化热密度 $Q_0$。推导热传导方程。 先解内部反应储量 → 取负时间导数作热源 → 除以体积热容。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-2", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-2", "labelEn": "Hydration heat in concrete", "textEn": "After concrete is poured, it releases hydration heat. The stored hydration-energy density $Q$ satisfies $dQ/dt=-\\beta Q$. The specific heat is $c$, density $\\rho$, and initial stored energy density $Q_0$. Derive the heat equation. Solve for the stored reaction energy → take its negative time derivative as the heat source → divide by volumetric heat capacity."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-3", "label": "受日照黑球的边界条件", "text": "半径 $r_0$、表面熏黑的金属球暴晒于日光下，太阳热流强度 $q_0$，环境温度 $\\theta$。确定边界条件。 表面受热 → 明确外法向 → 吸收减散热的通量平衡 → 投影日照角 → 写出采用的换热模型。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-3", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-3", "labelEn": "Boundary conditions for a sunlit blackened sphere", "textEn": "A metal sphere of radius $r_0$ has a blackened surface and is exposed to sunlight. Solar heat-flux intensity is $q_0$ and ambient temperature is $\\theta$. Determine the boundary condition. Surface heating → define the outward normal → balance absorption and heat loss against conduction → project the sunlight angle → state the heat-transfer law."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-4", "label": "固定—绝热杆的热衰减", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀细杆侧面绝热，$x=0$ 端保持零温，$x=l$ 端绝热，初温为 $x(l-x)$。(1)给出完整定解问题；(2)分离变量求温度随时间变化。 混合热边界 → 半整数正弦 → 初温投影 → 每模态乘扩散衰减指数。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-4", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-4", "labelEn": "Heat decay in a rod with one fixed-temperature and one insulated end", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod of length $l$ has an insulated lateral surface. Its end $x=0$ is held at zero temperature and its end $x=l$ is insulated. Initial temperature is $x(l-x)$. (1) Give the complete problem. (2) Find the time-dependent temperature by separation. Mixed thermal boundaries → half-integer sine modes → project the initial temperature → multiply each mode by its diffusion decay factor."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-5", "label": "固定—绝热杆的热衰减（原书重复题）", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀细杆侧面绝热，$x=0$ 端保持零温，$x=l$ 端绝热，初温为 $x(l-x)$。(1)给出完整定解问题；(2)分离变量求温度随时间变化。 混合热边界 → 半整数正弦 → 初温投影 → 每模态乘扩散衰减指数。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-5", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-5", "labelEn": "Heat decay in a rod with one fixed-temperature and one insulated end (duplicate in the textbook)", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod of length $l$ has an insulated lateral surface. Its end $x=0$ is held at zero temperature and its end $x=l$ is insulated. Initial temperature is $x(l-x)$. (1) Give the complete problem. (2) Find the time-dependent temperature by separation. Mixed thermal boundaries → half-integer sine modes → project the initial temperature → multiply each mode by its diffusion decay factor."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-6", "label": "已给模态的两端零温杆", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀杆侧面绝热，两端保持零温。初温 $3\\sin(\\pi x/l)+2\\sin(3\\pi x/l)$。(1)定解问题；(2)分离变量求解。 初温已是本征函数和 → 原系数不变 → 逐模态写指数衰减。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-6", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-6", "labelEn": "A zero-end-temperature rod with its modes already given", "textEn": "A uniform rod of length $l$ has an insulated lateral surface and both ends held at zero temperature. Its initial temperature is $3\\sin(\\pi x/l)+2\\sin(3\\pi x/l)$. (1) Formulate the problem. (2) Solve by separation. Initial temperature already given as eigenfunctions → keep their coefficients → attach the appropriate decay factor to each mode."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-7", "label": "温度正反馈与临界杆长", "text": "长 $l$ 的均匀细杆侧面绝热，两端温度零。内部单位长度、单位时间产热与当地温度成正比，比例系数 $\\beta>0$，初温 $\\varphi(x)$。(1)求温度；(2)求杆长超过后会发生温度增长的临界长度。 温度反馈源 → 保留物理单位归一化 → 模态增长率 → 第一模态临界 → 检查是否被初值激发。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-7", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-7", "labelEn": "Positive temperature feedback and a critical rod length", "textEn": "A uniform slender rod of length $l$ has an insulated lateral surface and zero temperature at both ends. Heat generated per unit length per unit time is proportional to the local temperature, with coefficient $\\beta>0$. Initial temperature is $\\varphi(x)$. (1) Find the temperature. (2) Find the critical length above which temperature growth is possible. Temperature-feedback source → normalize while retaining physical units → find modal growth rates → locate the first-mode threshold → check whether initial data excite growth."}, {"type": "习题 3.2-8", "label": "绝热正方形薄片", "text": "边长 $a$ 的均匀正方形薄片位于第一象限，一角在原点，四边绝热，初始温度分布 $\\varphi(x,y)$。求任意时刻温度。 全绝热 → Neumann双重余弦含零频 → 按零/非零频率范数投影 → 平均温度守恒。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.2-8", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.2-8", "labelEn": "An insulated square plate", "textEn": "A uniform square plate of side $a$ lies in the first quadrant with one corner at the origin. All four edges are insulated and its initial temperature is $\\varphi(x,y)$. Find the temperature at any time. All edges insulated → Neumann double-cosine basis including zero frequencies → project with the correct zero/nonzero norms → mean temperature is conserved."}, {"type": "习题 3.3-1", "label": "矩形顶边给定温度", "text": "求矩形内 $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$（$0<x<a,0<y<b$），$u(0,y)=u(a,y)=0$，$u(x,0)=0$，$u(x,b)=f(x)$。 三边零一边给定 → 齐次方向的本征函数 → 双曲传播比值 → 边界正交投影。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.3-1", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.3-1", "labelEn": "A rectangle with prescribed top-edge temperature", "textEn": "Solve $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$ in $0<x<a,0<y<b$, with $u(0,y)=u(a,y)=0$, $u(x,0)=0$, and $u(x,b)=f(x)$. Three zero edges and one prescribed edge → eigenfunctions in the homogeneous direction → a hyperbolic ratio across the rectangle → project the boundary values."}, {"type": "习题 3.3-2", "label": "矩形混合边界通量", "text": "求 $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$（$0<x<a,0<y<b$），$u(0,y)=0$、$u_x(a,y)=f(y)$，$u(x,0)=0$、$u_y(x,b)=0$。 混合齐次边界 → 半整数谱 → 非零通量边归一其导数 → 投影边界数据。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.3-2", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.3-2", "labelEn": "A rectangle with mixed boundaries and prescribed flux", "textEn": "Solve $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$ in $0<x<a,0<y<b$, with $u(0,y)=0$, $u_x(a,y)=f(y)$, $u(x,0)=0$, and $u_y(x,b)=0$. Homogeneous mixed boundaries → half-integer spectrum → normalize the derivative at the nonzero-flux edge → project the boundary data."}, {"type": "习题 3.3-3", "label": "两条非零边界的稳态叠加", "text": "矩形内 $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$；$u(0,y)=Ay(b-y)$、$u(a,y)=0$，$u(x,0)=B\\sin(\\pi x/a)$、$u(x,b)=0$。求 $u$。 多非零边 → 叠加拆成单边驱动 → 分别选择正交方向 → 最后逐边核对。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.3-3", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.3-3", "labelEn": "Superposition for two nonzero steady boundaries", "textEn": "Inside a rectangle, $u_{xx}+u_{yy}=0$. The boundaries are $u(0,y)=Ay(b-y)$, $u(a,y)=0$, $u(x,0)=B\\sin(\\pi x/a)$, and $u(x,b)=0$. Find $u$. Several nonzero edges → split into single-edge problems → choose the appropriate orthogonal direction for each → check every edge after adding."}, {"type": "习题 3.4-1", "label": "拉盖尔方程自伴化", "text": "将拉盖尔方程 $xy''+(1-x)y'+ay=0$ 化为标准施图姆–刘维尔形式，并确定权函数。 一般二阶方程自伴化 → 乘子使 $(\\mu a_2)'=\\mu a_1$ → 读出参数系数为权。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.4-1", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.4-1", "labelEn": "Self-adjoint form of Laguerre’s equation", "textEn": "Put Laguerre’s equation $xy''+(1-x)y'+ay=0$ in standard Sturm–Liouville form and determine its weight. Self-adjoint conversion → choose a multiplier satisfying $(\\mu a_2)'=\\mu a_1$ → identify the coefficient of the eigenvalue as the weight."}, {"type": "习题 3.4-2", "label": "埃尔米特方程自伴化", "text": "将埃尔米特方程 $y''-2xy'+2ay=0$ 化为标准施图姆–刘维尔形式，并确定权函数。 一阶导系数积分 → 高斯乘子 → 总导数 → 明确本征参数如何定义。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.4-2", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.4-2", "labelEn": "Self-adjoint form of Hermite’s equation", "textEn": "Put Hermite’s equation $y''-2xy'+2ay=0$ in standard Sturm–Liouville form and determine its weight. Integrate the first-derivative coefficient → obtain a Gaussian multiplier → form a total derivative → state the eigenvalue-parameter convention."}, {"type": "习题 3.4-3", "label": "切比雪夫方程自伴化", "text": "将切比雪夫方程 $(1-x^2)y''-xy'+n^2y=0$ 化为标准施图姆–刘维尔形式，并确定权函数。 配积分因子 → 读权函数 → 用三角换元检查正交权。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.4-3", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.4-3", "labelEn": "Self-adjoint form of Chebyshev’s equation", "textEn": "Put Chebyshev’s equation $(1-x^2)y''-xy'+n^2y=0$ in standard Sturm–Liouville form and determine its weight. Find an integrating factor → identify the weight → check the orthogonality weight by a trigonometric substitution."}, {"type": "习题 3.4-4", "label": "实谱证明与非负谱命题的反例", "text": "本征问题 $(k y')'-q y+\\lambda\\rho y=0$（$a<x<b$），边界 $\\alpha_1y(a)+\\alpha_2y'(a)=0$、$\\beta_1y(b)+\\beta_2y'(b)=0$。题给 $k,q,\\rho$ 为非负实函数、边界系数为实常数，要求证明：(1)本征值均为实数；(2)本征值均非负。 谱性质题 → 先查假设是否足够 → 共轭相减证明实性 → 能量商看符号 → 不足时提供具体反例与正确版本。", "url": "chapter-3.html#ex-3.4-4", "chapter": 3, "typeEn": "Exercise 3.4-4", "labelEn": "Real eigenvalues and a counterexample to nonnegativity", "textEn": "Consider $(k y')'-q y+\\lambda\\rho y=0$ for $a<x<b$, with $\\alpha_1y(a)+\\alpha_2y'(a)=0$ and $\\beta_1y(b)+\\beta_2y'(b)=0$. The question gives nonnegative real functions $k,q,\\rho$ and real boundary constants, and asks to prove: (1) all eigenvalues are real; (2) all eigenvalues are nonnegative. Spectral-property question → inspect the assumptions → subtract conjugates to prove reality → use the energy quotient for signs → when assumptions fail, give a concrete counterexample and a correct statement."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "朗斯基行列式与阿贝尔公式", "text": "二阶齐次线性方程的解空间在一个正则区间内是二维的。两个解能否作为一组基底，由 $W=y_1y_2\\prime-y_1\\prime y_2$ 判断。一个点的 $W\\ne0$ 已能保证整个正则区间内线性独立。 先除最高阶系数，再读出一阶导系数；W 的指数中带负号。", "url": "chapter-4.html#c4-4.1-wronskian", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "The Wronskian and Abel’s formula", "textEn": "On a regular interval, the solution space of a second-order homogeneous linear equation is two-dimensional. The Wronskian $W=y_1y_2\\prime-y_1\\prime y_2$ tests whether two solutions form a basis. If $W\\ne0$ at one point, they are linearly independent throughout that regular interval. First divide by the leading coefficient. Read off the coefficient of the first derivative; its integral enters the exponent with a minus sign."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "常点幂级数与正则奇点 Frobenius 法", "text": "常点用 $y=\\sum a_n(x-x_0)^n$；正则奇点用 $y=(x-x_0)^r\\sum a_n(x-x_0)^n$。最低次幂给指标方程，其余各次幂给递推。特殊函数的多项式解来自递推系数在某一级变成零。 最低幂找指数，同幂比较找递推，分母为零查对数。", "url": "chapter-4.html#c4-4.2-frobenius", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Power series at ordinary points and Frobenius series at regular singular points", "textEn": "At an ordinary point, use $y=\\sum a_n(x-x_0)^n$. At a regular singular point, use $y=(x-x_0)^r\\sum a_n(x-x_0)^n$. The lowest power gives the indicial equation; the remaining powers give a recurrence. A special-function solution becomes a polynomial when the recurrence terminates. Use the lowest power to find exponents, compare equal powers to find the recurrence, and check logarithms when a denominator vanishes."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "常数变易法", "text": "非齐次线性方程的通解等于齐次通解加一个特解。让齐次解前的常数变为函数，并增加一个辅助条件，可把求特解降为两个积分。 先齐次，后特解；变易积分前检查标准式。", "url": "chapter-4.html#c4-4.3-variation", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Variation of parameters", "textEn": "The general solution of a nonhomogeneous linear equation is the homogeneous general solution plus one particular solution. Replace the constants multiplying homogeneous solutions by functions. An extra auxiliary condition reduces the task to two integrations. Solve the homogeneous equation first, then find a particular solution. Check standard form before integrating."}, {"type": "习题 4.1-1", "label": "归一化单项式的线性独立性", "text": "利用朗斯基行列式证明函数组 $\\{x^n/n!,\\ n=0,1,\\ldots,N\\}$ 线性独立。 单项式组按次数升序排列，导数矩阵上三角，直接乘对角元。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.1-1", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.1-1", "labelEn": "Linear independence of normalized monomials", "textEn": "Use the Wronskian to prove that $\\{x^n/n!,\\ n=0,1,\\ldots,N\\}$ is linearly independent. Order monomials by increasing degree. The derivative matrix becomes upper triangular, so multiply its diagonal entries."}, {"type": "习题 4.1-2", "label": "W 恒为零时何时能推出相关", "text": "如果两个函数 $y_1(x)$ 和 $y_2(x)$ 的朗斯基行列式恒为零，证明它们满足 $y_1(x)=c y_2(x)$，$c$ 为常数，即线性相关。 W=0 先用商导数作局部证明；要全区间结论，补唯一性或解析性依据。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.1-2", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.1-2", "labelEn": "When does an identically zero Wronskian imply dependence?", "textEn": "If the Wronskian of two functions $y_1(x)$ and $y_2(x)$ is identically zero, prove that $y_1(x)=c y_2(x)$ for a constant $c$, so they are linearly dependent. For W=0, differentiate the quotient to get a local result. To extend across the full interval, justify uniqueness or analyticity."}, {"type": "习题 4.1-3", "label": "阿贝尔公式及教材公式的条件", "text": "证明二阶线性齐次常微分方程 $p(x)y\\prime\\prime+q(x)y\\prime+r(x)y=0$ 的朗斯基行列式为 $L=C/p(x)$，其中 $C$ 为常数。 先标准化，再用 W′=−(一阶导系数)W；遇 C/p 先检查自伴形式。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.1-3", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.1-3", "labelEn": "Abel’s formula and the condition missing from the textbook formula", "textEn": "Prove that the Wronskian of $p(x)y\\prime\\prime+q(x)y\\prime+r(x)y=0$ is $L=C/p(x)$, where $C$ is constant. First normalize the equation. Use W′=−(coefficient of the first derivative)W. Before using C/p, check self-adjoint form."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-1", "label": "Hermite 方程与终止级数", "text": "在 $x_0=0$ 邻域用级数求解 $y\\prime\\prime-2xy\\prime+(\\lambda-1)y=0$。确定何时解可退化为多项式。把最高次幂归一化为 $(2x)^n$ 得 $H_n(x)$，写出前三阶 Hermite 多项式。 求递推→令最高次那一级分子为零→保留同奇偶链→按最高次系数归一化。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-1", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-1", "labelEn": "Hermite’s equation and terminating series", "textEn": "Use a series near $x_0=0$ to solve $y\\prime\\prime-2xy\\prime+(\\lambda-1)y=0$. Determine when a solution becomes a polynomial. Normalize its leading term to $(2x)^n$ to obtain $H_n(x)$, and write the first three orders of Hermite polynomials. Find the recurrence → set its numerator to zero at the desired highest degree → retain the matching parity chain → normalize the leading coefficient."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-2", "label": "Chebyshev 方程的偶奇级数", "text": "在 $x_0=0$ 邻域用级数求解 $(1-x^2)y\\prime\\prime-xy\\prime+n^2y=0$。 含 1−x² 的方程先做常点级数；用 x=sin t 或 cos t 检查特殊函数。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-2", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-2", "labelEn": "Even and odd series for Chebyshev’s equation", "textEn": "Use a series near $x_0=0$ to solve $(1-x^2)y\\prime\\prime-xy\\prime+n^2y=0$. For an equation containing 1−x², first try an ordinary-point series. Check special-function expressions with x=sin t or cos t."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-3", "label": "超几何方程的 Frobenius 级数", "text": "在 $x_0=0$ 邻域用级数求解 $x(x-1)y\\prime\\prime+[(1+a+b)x-c]y\\prime+aby=0$。 标准化符号→指标方程→递推→识别 Pochhammer 系数→检查参数分母及整数差。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-3", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-3", "labelEn": "Frobenius series for the hypergeometric equation", "textEn": "Use a series near $x_0=0$ to solve $x(x-1)y\\prime\\prime+[(1+a+b)x-c]y\\prime+aby=0$. Correct the standard-form signs → derive the indicial equation → find the recurrence → identify Pochhammer coefficients → check denominator parameters and integer root differences."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-4", "label": "合流超几何方程", "text": "在 $x=0$ 邻域求解 $xy\\prime\\prime+(c-x)y\\prime-ay=0$。 合流型递推“一个升阶因子除两个因子”；整数 c 不能略过共振检查。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-4", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-4", "labelEn": "The confluent hypergeometric equation", "textEn": "Solve $xy\\prime\\prime+(c-x)y\\prime-ay=0$ near $x=0$. The confluent recurrence has one rising factor divided by two factors. For integer c, always check resonance."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-5", "label": "Legendre 方程在 x=1 的展开", "text": "在 $x=1$ 邻域求解 $(1-x^2)y\\prime\\prime-2xy\\prime+l(l+1)y=0$。 移奇点→重指标→求一支→用 W 或降阶积分构造对数支。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-5", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-5", "labelEn": "Expansion of Legendre’s equation near x=1", "textEn": "Solve $(1-x^2)y\\prime\\prime-2xy\\prime+l(l+1)y=0$ near $x=1$. Shift the singular point → find the repeated indicial root → obtain one solution → use the Wronskian or reduction of order to construct the logarithmic solution."}, {"type": "习题 4.2-6", "label": "Laguerre 方程与教材的归一化", "text": "在 $x=0$ 邻域求解 $xy\\prime\\prime+(1-x)y\\prime+\\lambda y=0$。确定多项式解的参数；最高次幂归一化为 $(-x)^n$ 得 $L_n(x)$，写出前三阶。 递推分子归零定本征参数，最后通过最高次系数确定整体倍数。", "url": "chapter-4.html#ex-4.2-6", "chapter": 4, "typeEn": "Exercise 4.2-6", "labelEn": "Laguerre’s equation and the textbook normalization", "textEn": "Solve $xy\\prime\\prime+(1-x)y\\prime+\\lambda y=0$ near $x=0$. Determine the parameter values giving polynomial solutions. Normalize the leading term to $(-x)^n$ to obtain $L_n(x)$, and write its first three orders. Set the recurrence numerator to zero to find the allowed parameter. Then use the leading coefficient to determine the overall scale."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "拉梅系数与曲线坐标算符", "text": "正交坐标的微小实际长度是 $ds_i=h_i dq_i$。梯度、散度与拉普拉斯算符中的尺度因子，分别来自长度、面积和体积的变化。 长度看 h，面积看两个 h，体积看三个 h。", "url": "chapter-5.html#c5-5.1-lame", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Lamé scale factors and curvilinear differential operators", "textEn": "Changing a coordinate does not always move you by the same physical distance. In orthogonal coordinates, the actual small length is $ds_i=h_i dq_i$. These scale factors enter the gradient, divergence, and Laplacian because lengths, areas, and volumes change with position. A length uses one h; an area uses two h factors; a volume uses three."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "球谐展开与球内、球外径向解", "text": "球面边界最适合球谐函数。轴对称时角函数为 $P_l(\\cos\\theta)$；每一角模态只有两个径向幂 $r^l$ 与 $r^{-l-1}$。球内舍去奇异幂，球外衰减解舍去增长幂。 角度先拆成 P 或 Y，区域再决定保留哪一个径向幂。", "url": "chapter-5.html#c5-5.2-solid-harmonics", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Spherical-harmonic expansions and interior/exterior radial solutions", "textEn": "A spherical boundary suggests spherical harmonics: functions that separate the angular dependence into simple modes. With axial symmetry, the angular functions are $P_l(\\cos\\theta)$. Every angular mode has two radial powers, $r^l$ and $r^{-l-1}$. Inside a ball, remove the singular power; outside, remove the growing power when decay is required. First split the angular data into P or Y modes. Then use the region to select the allowed radial power."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "圆柱中的 Bessel 展开", "text": "圆柱轴对称径向算符是 $R\\prime\\prime+R\\prime/\\rho$，本征函数为 $J_0(k\\rho)$，其正交权为 $\\rho$。侧面零温时 k 由 $J_0(ka)=0$ 决定；把上下底面先做正弦分解时，径向反而出现 $I_0$。 柱坐标积分带 ρ；侧面先齐次选 J，上下底先齐次常选 I。", "url": "chapter-5.html#c5-5.3-bessel", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Bessel expansions in a cylinder", "textEn": "For axial symmetry, the radial operator is $R\\prime\\prime+R\\prime/\\rho$. Its eigenfunctions are $J_0(k\\rho)$, with orthogonality weight $\\rho$: coefficient integrals must include that extra factor. A zero side boundary selects k through $J_0(ka)=0$. If you first use sine modes to satisfy the two end faces, the radial function becomes $I_0$ instead. Cylindrical projection integrals carry ρ. Satisfy the side first: often J. Satisfy the end faces first: often I."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "空间本征值决定扩散速度与振动频率", "text": "热方程和波动方程分离变量后，共用 $\\nabla^2X+k^2X=0$ 的空间本征问题。热问题各模态按 $e^{-Dk^2t}$ 衰减；波动问题各模态以 $ck$ 振荡。球中角阶 l 的径向函数是球 Bessel 函数 $j_l(kr)$。 同一空间模态：扩散看 k²，振动看 k。", "url": "chapter-5.html#c5-5.4-heat-modes", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Spatial eigenvalues determine diffusion rates and vibration frequencies", "textEn": "After separation of variables, heat and wave equations share the spatial eigenproblem $\\nabla^2X+k^2X=0$. An eigenfunction is one spatial pattern that evolves without changing shape. A heat mode decays as $e^{-Dk^2t}$; a wave mode oscillates with angular frequency $ck$. In a sphere, angular order l uses the spherical Bessel function $j_l(kr)$. For the same spatial mode, diffusion uses k² and vibration uses k."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "变截面细杆与环形膜", "text": "几何形状会改变微分算符：截面积 $A(x)$ 的细杆纵振动满足 $u_{tt}=c^2A^{-1}(Au_x)_x$；楔杆 $A\\propto x$ 对应普通 Bessel，锥杆 $A\\propto x^2$ 对应球 Bessel。环形膜不包含原点，不能因 $Y_m$ 在零点发散就舍掉它。 先算截面积随 x 的幂，再决定 Bessel 类型；环域保留两类解。", "url": "chapter-5.html#c5-5.5-taper", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Tapered rods and annular membranes", "textEn": "Geometry changes the differential operator. A rod with cross-sectional area $A(x)$ obeys $u_{tt}=c^2A^{-1}(Au_x)_x$ for longitudinal vibration. A wedge with $A\\propto x$ leads to ordinary Bessel functions; a cone with $A\\propto x^2$ leads to spherical Bessel functions. An annular membrane excludes the origin, so divergence of $Y_m$ at zero is not a reason to discard it. First find how cross-sectional area depends on x, then choose the Bessel type. In a ring domain, keep both independent radial solutions."}, {"type": "习题 5.1-1", "label": "正交曲线坐标的旋度公式", "text": "对矢量 $\\mathbf A(q_1,q_2,q_3)$，旋度第 i 分量由包围该点、法线为 $\\mathbf e_i$ 的无穷小面上的右手定向环量除以面积定义。证明\n$$\\nabla\\times\\mathbf A=\\frac{\\partial_{q_2}(A_3h_3)-\\partial_{q_3}(A_2h_2)}{h_2h_3}\\mathbf e_1+\\frac{\\partial_{q_3}(A_1h_1)-\\partial_{q_1}(A_3h_3)}{h_3h_1}\\mathbf e_2+\\frac{\\partial_{q_1}(A_2h_2)-\\partial_{q_2}(A_1h_1)}{h_1h_2}\\mathbf e_3.$$ 画定向微小矩形→四边积分→成对差分→除面积→循环置换。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.1-1", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.1-1", "labelEn": "The curl formula in orthogonal curvilinear coordinates", "textEn": "For a vector $\\mathbf A(q_1,q_2,q_3)$, define the ith curl component as the right-hand-oriented circulation around an infinitesimal surface with normal $\\mathbf e_i$, divided by its area. Prove\n$$\\nabla\\times\\mathbf A=\\frac{\\partial_{q_2}(A_3h_3)-\\partial_{q_3}(A_2h_2)}{h_2h_3}\\mathbf e_1+\\frac{\\partial_{q_3}(A_1h_1)-\\partial_{q_1}(A_3h_3)}{h_3h_1}\\mathbf e_2+\\frac{\\partial_{q_1}(A_2h_2)-\\partial_{q_2}(A_1h_1)}{h_1h_2}\\mathbf e_3.$$ Draw an oriented tiny rectangle → integrate along its four edges → pair and subtract opposite edges → divide by area → cyclically permute."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-1", "label": "Legendre 多项式在 −1 的值", "text": "证明任意阶 Legendre 多项式 $P_l(x)$ 在 $x=-1$ 处取值 $P_l(-1)=(-1)^l$。 端点或奇偶性问题优先代生成函数，再比较同次幂系数。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-1", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-1", "labelEn": "The value of a Legendre polynomial at −1", "textEn": "Prove that a Legendre polynomial $P_l(x)$ of any order has value $P_l(-1)=(-1)^l$ at $x=-1$. For endpoint values or parity, try substituting into the generating function and comparing equal powers."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-2", "label": "五条 Legendre 导数递推关系", "text": "证明教材 (5.2.58)–(5.2.62)：\n$$P_l=P_{l+1}\\prime-2xP_l\\prime+P_{l-1}\\prime;\\quad (2l+1)P_l=P_{l+1}\\prime-P_{l-1}\\prime;$$\n$$P_{l+1}\\prime=(l+1)P_l+xP_l\\prime;\\quad lP_l=xP_l\\prime-P_{l-1}\\prime;$$\n$$ (2l+1)xP_l\\prime=lP_{l+1}\\prime+(l+1)P_{l-1}\\prime.$$ 先引入 G，把含导数递推翻译为 Gₓ、Gₜ 恒等式，再逐项比较。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-2", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-2", "labelEn": "Five derivative recurrence relations for Legendre polynomials", "textEn": "Prove textbook Eqs. (5.2.58)–(5.2.62):\n$$P_l=P_{l+1}\\prime-2xP_l\\prime+P_{l-1}\\prime;\\quad (2l+1)P_l=P_{l+1}\\prime-P_{l-1}\\prime;$$\n$$P_{l+1}\\prime=(l+1)P_l+xP_l\\prime;\\quad lP_l=xP_l\\prime-P_{l-1}\\prime;$$\n$$ (2l+1)xP_l\\prime=lP_{l+1}\\prime+(l+1)P_{l-1}\\prime.$$ Introduce G → translate derivative recurrences into Gₓ and Gₜ identities → compare coefficients of equal powers."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-3", "label": "多项式的 Legendre 展开（四问）", "text": "以 $P_l(x)$ 为基底，在 $[-1,1]$ 展开：\n1. $2x^3+3x+4$；\n2. $x^4+2x^3$；\n3. $x^3$；\n4. $1+x+2x^2+3x^3$。 有限次多项式→写同次数低阶 Pₗ→从最高次倒推系数→按奇偶检查。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-3", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-3", "labelEn": "Four polynomial expansions in Legendre polynomials", "textEn": "Expand in the basis $P_l(x)$ on $[-1,1]$:\n1. $2x^3+3x+4$;\n2. $x^4+2x^3$;\n3. $x^3$;\n4. $1+x+2x^2+3x^3$. Finite polynomial → list low-order Pₗ through the same degree → work down from the highest power → check parity."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-4", "label": "匀强电场中的接地导体球", "text": "在场强为 $E_0$ 的匀强电场中放入半径 a 的接地导体球，求球外电势分布及电场强度。 远场决定增长模态，导体表面条件决定衰减模态，最后取负梯度。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-4", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-4", "labelEn": "A grounded conducting sphere in a uniform electric field", "textEn": "A grounded conducting sphere of radius a is placed in a uniform electric field of strength $E_0$. Find the exterior potential and electric field. The far field fixes the growing mode → the conductor boundary fixes the decaying mode → take the negative gradient."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-5", "label": "均匀带电圆环的空间电势", "text": "半径 R 的均匀带电细圆环，总电量 Q，求空间电势分布。 先固定源几何与零势→库仑核生成函数→源角平均→内外分别选径向幂。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-5", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-5", "labelEn": "The potential of a uniformly charged circular ring", "textEn": "A thin circular ring of radius R carries a uniform total charge Q. Find its potential throughout space. Fix the source geometry and potential reference → expand the Coulomb kernel with the generating function → average over the source angle → use the correct interior/exterior radial powers."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-6", "label": "分割导体球壳的内外电势", "text": "半径 R 的导体球壳，在 $\\theta=\\theta_0$ 处用绝缘细环分成两部分。上部接地、下部保持电势 U。求球壳内部与外部电势分布。 阶跃边界→写清积分区间→计算球面系数→同一系数配内外幂。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-6", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-6", "labelEn": "Interior and exterior potentials of a divided conducting spherical shell", "textEn": "A conducting spherical shell of radius R is divided by a thin insulating ring at $\\theta=\\theta_0$. The upper part is grounded and the lower part is held at potential U. Find the interior and exterior potentials. Step boundary → identify the integration interval → compute surface coefficients → attach the interior/exterior powers to the same coefficients."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-7", "label": "球外 Robin 边界与共振参数", "text": "在球外求解 $\\nabla^2u=0$（$r>R$），边界 $[u+h\\,\\partial_ru]_{r=R}=5\\cos3\\theta$，h 为常数。 角模态分解→径向导数作用在每个幂→逐模态除 Robin 因子→检查零分母及无穷条件。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-7", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-7", "labelEn": "An exterior Robin boundary and resonant parameters", "textEn": "Solve $\\nabla^2u=0$ for $r>R$, with $[u+h\\,\\partial_ru]_{r=R}=5\\cos3\\theta$, where h is constant. Split angular modes → differentiate each radial power → divide by its Robin factor → check zero denominators and infinity."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-8", "label": "厚球壳的混合角模态稳态温度", "text": "均匀厚球壳内半径 $R_1$、外半径 $R_2$，无热源热汇；内表面温度 $2(1-\\cos\\theta)$，外表面温度 $\\sin\\theta\\sin\\phi$。求壳内稳态温度。 按球谐阶分组，分别用两个径向幂构造边界插值，最后线性叠加。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-8", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-8", "labelEn": "Steady temperature in a thick spherical shell with mixed angular modes", "textEn": "A uniform thick spherical shell has inner radius $R_1$ and outer radius $R_2$, with no heat sources or sinks. The inner temperature is $2(1-\\cos\\theta)$ and the outer temperature is $\\sin\\theta\\sin\\phi$. Find its steady temperature. Group the data by spherical-harmonic order → combine the two radial powers into boundary interpolation functions → add the modes."}, {"type": "习题 5.2-9", "label": "球面二次函数的调和延拓", "text": "半径 R 的均匀球体，表面温度为 $3\\sin^2\\theta\\cos^2\\phi$，求球内稳态温度。 低次球面多项式先找常数平均与无迹调和部分，再乘相应 rˡ。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.2-9", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.2-9", "labelEn": "Harmonic extension of quadratic data on a sphere", "textEn": "A uniform ball of radius R has surface temperature $3\\sin^2\\theta\\cos^2\\phi$. Find the steady interior temperature. For low-degree surface polynomials, find the constant average and the traceless harmonic remainder, then attach the corresponding rˡ factor."}, {"type": "习题 5.3-1", "label": "圆柱底面为 ρ² 的稳态温度", "text": "半径 $\\rho_0$、高 h 的均质圆柱体，上底和侧面保持零温，下底温度 $f(\\rho)=\\rho^2$。求柱内稳态温度。 侧面先齐次→J₀ 正零点→轴向满足另一底面→按 ρ 权投影非齐次底面。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.3-1", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.3-1", "labelEn": "Steady cylinder temperature with a ρ² bottom boundary", "textEn": "A uniform cylinder has radius $\\rho_0$ and height h. Its top and side are held at zero temperature, while the bottom has temperature $f(\\rho)=\\rho^2$. Find the steady temperature. Satisfy the homogeneous side → use positive J₀ zeros → satisfy the opposite end face axially → project the nonzero bottom data with weight ρ."}, {"type": "习题 5.3-2", "label": "恒温侧面的圆柱稳态温度", "text": "半径 $\\rho_0$、高 h 的均质圆柱体，上下底面零温，侧面保持温度 $u_0$。求柱内稳态温度。 两个底面同为零→正弦本征值→修正 Bessel 径向→侧面函数正弦投影。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.3-2", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.3-2", "labelEn": "Steady cylinder temperature with a constant-temperature side", "textEn": "A uniform cylinder has radius $\\rho_0$ and height h. Its two ends are held at zero temperature and its side at $u_0$. Find the steady temperature. Both ends zero → sine eigenvalues → modified Bessel radial function → sine projection of the side data."}, {"type": "习题 5.3-3", "label": "侧面自由冷却的圆柱", "text": "半径 $\\rho_0$、高 h 的均质圆柱体，上底温度为 $f(\\rho)$，下底零温，侧面在零温空气中自由冷却。求柱内稳态温度。 先把物理散热律转成带正确法向符号的 Robin 条件，再定根与范数。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.3-3", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.3-3", "labelEn": "A cylinder with convective cooling on its side", "textEn": "A uniform cylinder has radius $\\rho_0$ and height h. Its top temperature is $f(\\rho)$, its bottom is at zero, and its side cools freely into zero-temperature air. Find the steady temperature. Translate the physical cooling law into a Robin condition with the correct outward-normal sign → find the roots and norm → project the boundary data."}, {"type": "习题 5.4-1", "label": "圆柱混合边界的热扩散", "text": "半径 $\\rho_0$、高 h 的均质圆柱，下底和侧面保持 $u_0$，上底绝热，初始温度 $u_0+f(\\rho)g(z)$。求各点温度随时间变化。 减稳态→两方向本征值→乘积初值各自投影→时间指数叠加。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.4-1", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.4-1", "labelEn": "Heat diffusion in a cylinder with mixed boundaries", "textEn": "A uniform cylinder has radius $\\rho_0$ and height h. The bottom and side are held at $u_0$, the top is insulated, and the initial temperature is $u_0+f(\\rho)g(z)$. Find the temperature as a function of time. Subtract the steady state → find eigenvalues in both directions → project each initial-data factor → add exponentially decaying modes."}, {"type": "习题 5.4-2", "label": "均匀初温球体的冷却", "text": "半径 R 的均匀导热介质球，初始温度 $u_0$；球面保持零温，求球内温度随时间变化。 球对称→乘 r 消去一阶导→一维零端热方程→最后除 r，并单独取中心极限。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.4-2", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.4-2", "labelEn": "Cooling a ball with uniform initial temperature", "textEn": "A uniform conducting ball of radius R initially has temperature $u_0$. Its surface is held at zero temperature. Find the interior temperature as a function of time. Spherical symmetry → multiply by r to remove the first derivative → solve a one-dimensional heat equation with zero ends → divide by r and take the center limit separately."}, {"type": "习题 5.4-3", "label": "初温含 cosθ 的球体冷却", "text": "半径 R 的均匀导热介质球，初始温度 $f(r)\\cos\\theta$；置入冰水后球面保持零温，求球内温度变化。 识别初值球谐阶 l→选 j_l→由表面零温定正根→按 r² 权展开。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.4-3", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.4-3", "labelEn": "Cooling a ball whose initial temperature contains cosθ", "textEn": "A uniform conducting ball of radius R initially has temperature $f(r)\\cos\\theta$. It is placed in ice water, keeping the surface at zero temperature. Find the interior temperature evolution. Identify the initial angular order l → choose j_l → use the zero surface value to find positive roots → expand with weight r²."}, {"type": "习题 5.5-1", "label": "自由楔形细杆纵振动", "text": "均质楔形细杆长 l、宽 ε 很小且首尾同宽，粗端高度 h；x 轴沿杆，削尖一端平衡位置为原点。两端自由，初速度零、初位移 f(x)。求纵振动。 截面 A(x)→自伴纵振方程→端点有限/自由条件→加零模态→以 A 权投影。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.5-1", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.5-1", "labelEn": "Longitudinal vibration of a free wedge-shaped slender rod", "textEn": "A uniform-material wedge-shaped slender rod has length l, small constant width ε, and thick-end height h. The x axis runs along the rod, with its sharp tip at x=0. Both ends are free, the initial velocity is zero, and the initial displacement is f(x). Find its longitudinal vibration. Find A(x) → derive the self-adjoint longitudinal equation → impose finite/free endpoint conditions → include the zero mode → project with weight A."}, {"type": "习题 5.5-2", "label": "固定环形膜的本征振动与频率", "text": "内外边缘固定且张紧的环形膜，内、外半径分别 $\\rho_1,\\rho_2$。求本征振动与本征频率。 周期角函数→Bessel 双解→两个边界列行列式→正根给频率→检查简并。", "url": "chapter-5.html#ex-5.5-2", "chapter": 5, "typeEn": "Exercise 5.5-2", "labelEn": "Normal modes and frequencies of a fixed annular membrane", "textEn": "A taut annular membrane has fixed inner and outer edges of radii $\\rho_1,\\rho_2$. Find its normal modes and natural frequencies. Periodic angular functions → two Bessel radial solutions → determinant from two boundaries → positive roots give frequencies → check degeneracy."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "格林函数：算符对点源的响应", "text": "把一般源分解成点源，先求算符对一个点源的响应，再积分叠加。本章采用教材约定 $\\Delta G=\\delta$；若改用 $-\\Delta G=\\delta$，所有格林函数整体变号。 一维折线、二维对数、三维倒数；先做通量检查正负号。", "url": "chapter-6.html#c6-fundamental", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Green functions: the response to a point source", "textEn": "Imagine building a general source from many tiny point sources. First find the response to one unit point source, then add the responses by integration. This chapter follows the textbook convention $\\Delta G=\\delta$; with the alternative convention $-\\Delta G=\\delta$, every Green function changes its overall sign. One dimension: a V-shaped line. Two dimensions: a logarithm. Three dimensions: an inverse distance. Check the sign with flux."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "Dirichlet 格林函数与边界积分", "text": "格林函数既要产生单位点源，还要满足齐次边界条件。镜像源放在求解区域之外，目的在于抵消边界值，不能在区域内部额外制造奇点。 先对算符，再对边界，再对无穷远；表面积分用外法向。", "url": "chapter-6.html#c6-dirichlet", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Dirichlet Green functions and boundary integrals", "textEn": "A Green function must produce one unit point source and satisfy a zero boundary condition. An image source is an imaginary helper placed outside the region being solved. Its job is to cancel the boundary value; it must not introduce another singularity inside the region. Check the operator, then the boundary, then infinity. The surface integral uses the outward normal."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "Neumann 相容条件、常数自由度与 Robin 边界", "text": "给定法向导数并不确定整体常数。更关键的是源的总量必须等于流出边界的总通量。有界域中不能同时要求 $\\Delta G=\\delta$ 和处处零法向导数。 纯通量边界：先算总量，再谈解；加常数不改变通量。", "url": "chapter-6.html#c6-neumann", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Neumann compatibility, the arbitrary constant, and Robin boundaries", "textEn": "Prescribing the normal derivative does not fix the overall constant in u. Before solving, check that the total source equals the total outward boundary flux. In a bounded domain, a Green function cannot satisfy both $\\Delta G=\\delta$ and zero normal derivative everywhere. For flux-only boundaries, check the total balance first. Adding a constant does not change the flux."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "亥姆霍兹基本解与辐射条件", "text": "对空间简谐波，径向基本解是球面波除以距离。正负指数都满足同一个点源方程，区别来自辐射条件；判断出射和入射还必须说明时间因子。 径向乘 R 变成简谐方程；δ 的系数用通量定。", "url": "chapter-6.html#c6-helmholtz", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Helmholtz fundamental solutions and radiation conditions", "textEn": "For a time-harmonic wave, the radial fundamental solution is a spherical wave divided by distance. Both signs in the exponential satisfy the same point-source equation. The radiation condition selects one sign, and the time factor tells us which wave is outgoing. Multiply the radial function by R to get a harmonic-oscillator equation. Use flux to fix the δ coefficient."}, {"type": "知识点", "label": "推迟格林函数与因果响应", "text": "波动信息以有限速度传播：观察点当前的响应，来自源点在 $R/c$ 之前的作用。推迟解要求响应不早于源的激发。 先选因果方向；把源的 t 换成 t−R/c；检查算符前的 c²。", "url": "chapter-6.html#c6-retarded", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Concept", "labelEn": "Retarded Green functions and causal response", "textEn": "A wave travels at a finite speed. The response observed now comes from what the source did $R/c$ earlier. A retarded solution is causal: it cannot respond before the source acts or before the signal arrives. Choose the causal direction; replace the source time t by t−R/c; check the c² factor in the operator."}, {"type": "习题 6.1-1", "label": "一维无界空间的拉普拉斯基本解", "text": "求一维无界空间上拉普拉斯算子的格林函数。 写算符约定→源点外分段求解→排除 δ′ 保持连续→积分定导数跳跃→说明齐次自由度。", "url": "chapter-6.html#ex-6.1-1", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Exercise 6.1-1", "labelEn": "The Laplacian fundamental solution on the whole line", "textEn": "Find the Green function of the Laplacian on the unbounded one-dimensional line. State the sign convention → solve in two pieces away from the source → require continuity to avoid δ′ → integrate to find the derivative jump → identify the homogeneous freedom."}, {"type": "习题 6.2-1", "label": "上半空间 Poisson 方程的 Dirichlet 解", "text": "在三维半空间 $y>0$ 求 $\\Delta u=f(\\mathbf r)$，边界 $u(x,0,z)=\\varphi(x,z)$。 画反射点→基本解减镜像→检验边界与域内源→算外法向导数→代格林公式→检验常数边界。", "url": "chapter-6.html#ex-6.2-1", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Exercise 6.2-1", "labelEn": "The Dirichlet solution of Poisson’s equation in the upper half-space", "textEn": "Solve $\\Delta u=f(\\mathbf r)$ in the three-dimensional half-space $y>0$, with $u(x,0,z)=\\varphi(x,z)$. Draw the reflected point → subtract the image fundamental solution → check the boundary and interior source → calculate the outward normal derivative → apply Green’s formula → test a constant boundary value."}, {"type": "习题 6.2-2", "label": "圆盘内的 Poisson 积分公式", "text": "在半径 a 的圆内求 $\\Delta u=0$，$u(a,\\theta)=f(\\theta)$。 反演找镜像→对数常数调零边界→计算外法向导数→乘弧长元→用常数/单一 Fourier 模态验算。", "url": "chapter-6.html#ex-6.2-2", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Exercise 6.2-2", "labelEn": "The Poisson integral formula inside a disk", "textEn": "Solve $\\Delta u=0$ inside a disk of radius a, with $u(a,\\theta)=f(\\theta)$. Invert to locate the image → adjust the logarithmic constant to make the boundary zero → calculate the outward derivative → multiply by the arc element → test a constant or a single Fourier mode."}, {"type": "习题 6.2-3", "label": "球外区域的 Dirichlet 格林函数", "text": "在半径 a 的球外区域，利用镜像法求 Poisson 方程第一边值问题的格林函数，并与例 5.2.2 比较。 反演定位置→球面距离比定系数→查真实源归一化→查边界与无穷远→用 Φ=−qG/ε₀ 对照电势。", "url": "chapter-6.html#ex-6.2-3", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Exercise 6.2-3", "labelEn": "The Dirichlet Green function outside a sphere", "textEn": "Use the image method to find the Green function for the first boundary-value problem of Poisson’s equation outside a sphere of radius a. Compare it with Example 5.2.2. Invert to find the location → use the sphere-distance ratio for the coefficient → check real-source normalization → check the boundary and infinity → compare potentials using Φ=−qG/ε₀."}, {"type": "习题 6.4-1", "label": "验证两种亥姆霍兹点源基本解", "text": "证明教材式 (6.4.15) 给出的两个函数 $G_\\pm(r)=-e^{\\pm i\\omega r}/(4\\pi r)$ 都是式 (6.4.8) 的解，即满足 $(\\Delta+\\omega^2)G_\\pm=\\delta(\\mathbf r)$。 径向乘 r 降阶→求二阶导验齐次→展开奇异主部→通量定 δ 系数→说明辐射条件。", "url": "chapter-6.html#ex-6.4-1", "chapter": 6, "typeEn": "Exercise 6.4-1", "labelEn": "Verifying both Helmholtz point-source fundamental solutions", "textEn": "Prove that both functions $G_\\pm(r)=-e^{\\pm i\\omega r}/(4\\pi r)$ given in textbook Eq. (6.4.15) solve Eq. (6.4.8), namely $(\\Delta+\\omega^2)G_\\pm=\\delta(\\mathbf r)$. Multiply the radial function by r → differentiate twice to check the homogeneous equation → expand the singular part → fix the δ coefficient by flux → state the radiation condition."}];
